Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:32.90,*Default,1,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:58.67,*Default,2,0,0,0,,With every sun comes a new day.  A new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:01:02.31,*Default,3,0,0,0,,A hope that things will be better today  than they were yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.15,*Default,4,0,0,0,,But not for me.  My name is Eep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:09.43,*Default,5,0,0,0,,And this is my family, the Croods.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:12.86,*Default,6,0,0,0,,If you weren't clued in already by the animal skins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:15.67,*Default,7,0,0,0,,and sloping foreheads,  we're cavemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:19.99,*Default,8,0,0,0,,Most days we spend in our cave,  in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:24.67,*Default,9,0,0,0,,Night after night, day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.84,0:01:28.87,*Default,10,0,0,0,,Yep, home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:31.11,*Default,11,0,0,0,,When we did go out, we struggled to find food
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.11,0:01:33.83,*Default,12,0,0,0,,in a harsh and hostile world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:38.78,*Default,13,0,0,0,,And I struggled to survive my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:42.95,*Default,14,0,0,0,,We were the last ones around.  There used to be neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:45.67,*Default,15,0,0,0,,The Gorts, smashed by a mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.79,*Default,16,0,0,0,,The Horks, swallowed by a sand snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.19,*Default,17,0,0,0,,The Erfs, mosquito bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:55.03,*Default,18,0,0,0,,Throgs, common cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:57.95,*Default,19,0,0,0,,And the Croods, that's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:01.79,*Default,20,0,0,0,,The Croods made it, because of my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:05.55,*Default,21,0,0,0,,He was strong,  and he followed the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.51,*Default,22,0,0,0,,The ones painted on the cave walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:10.19,*Default,23,0,0,0,,Anything new is bad, curiosity is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.70,*Default,24,0,0,0,,Going out at night is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.70,0:02:14.67,*Default,25,0,0,0,,Basically, anything fun is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.83,*Default,26,0,0,0,,Welcome to my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:19.40,*Default,27,0,0,0,,But this is a story about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.40,0:02:22.39,*Default,28,0,0,0,,how all that changed in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:25.80,*Default,29,0,0,0,,Because what we didn't know  was that our world...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.39,*Default,30,0,0,0,,was about to come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:33.83,*Default,31,0,0,0,,And there were no rules on our  cave walls to prepare us for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.95,*Default,32,0,0,0,,You are supposed to wait  for my signal. Eep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.19,*Default,33,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.59,*Default,34,0,0,0,,Ow! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.95,*Default,35,0,0,0,,We've been in that cave forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.42,*Default,36,0,0,0,,Three days is not forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.03,*Default,37,0,0,0,,It is with this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:20.59,*Default,38,0,0,0,,Eep, would you come down here?  You're being so dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:24.47,*Default,39,0,0,0,,No, Sandy, come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.51,*Default,40,0,0,0,,Remember the signal.  Good girls wait for the signal. Ugga.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.27,*Default,41,0,0,0,,As soon as I get Sandy, I'll go back in,  and you can give the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.11,*Default,42,0,0,0,,No, I mean, you're already out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.95,*Default,43,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for the signal, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.31,*Default,44,0,0,0,,Never mind, Thunk. Just come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:41.10,*Default,45,0,0,0,,But if you don't give the signal,  how do I know you're my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:42.95,*Default,46,0,0,0,,The signal isn't so you know it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:45.95,*Default,47,0,0,0,,It's so you know I wasn't eaten  by an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.10,*Default,48,0,0,0,,Then why is the signal an animal noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:50.03,*Default,49,0,0,0,,Doesn't that just confuse things?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.55,*Default,50,0,0,0,,I don't know.  I'm still waiting for the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:15.07,*Default,51,0,0,0,,Mom, we're ready to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:17.43,*Default,52,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:21.87,*Default,53,0,0,0,,Still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.43,*Default,54,0,0,0,,It's still early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:26.31,*Default,55,0,0,0,,And you're still fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.63,*Default,56,0,0,0,,Breakfast formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:33.23,*Default,57,0,0,0,,I want to see some real caveman action  out there. We do this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:36.07,*Default,58,0,0,0,,We do this loud.  We do this as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.63,*Default,59,0,0,0,,And never not be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:42.84,*Default,60,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.43,*Default,61,0,0,0,,Yay, breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:17.54,*Default,62,0,0,0,,Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.59,*Default,63,0,0,0,,We'll flip for it.  Call her in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.63,*Default,64,0,0,0,,Heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:26.55,*Default,65,0,0,0,,Tails. Thunk is in. Positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.83,*Default,66,0,0,0,,Okay. Thunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.39,*Default,67,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.23,*Default,68,0,0,0,,Come on, Thunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.55,*Default,69,0,0,0,,Way to go.  Take it to the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.03,*Default,70,0,0,0,,Release the baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:50.23,*Default,71,0,0,0,,Get them, Sandy! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.87,*Default,72,0,0,0,,Get them, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:46.27,*Default,73,0,0,0,,Old lady down!  Eep, avenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.02,*Default,74,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.51,*Default,75,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.39,*Default,76,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.07,*Default,77,0,0,0,,Hey Dad, can we eat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.27,*Default,78,0,0,0,,Just wait till we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.63,*Default,79,0,0,0,,Eep, put on the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.06,*Default,80,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:38.67,*Default,81,0,0,0,,-Who is hungry?  -All right! Good one, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:41.27,*Default,82,0,0,0,,Here you go, Thunk. Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:46.43,*Default,83,0,0,0,,-Sorry, Dad.  -Looks like fast food tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:04.95,*Default,84,0,0,0,,That's all right. I ate last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.15,*Default,85,0,0,0,,Two knuckle warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.82,*Default,86,0,0,0,,Come on, Croods. Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:19.11,*Default,87,0,0,0,,Come on, come on. Darkness brings death.  We know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:22.46,*Default,88,0,0,0,,The moon is full. Bath night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:25.02,*Default,89,0,0,0,,-Run for your life!  -You too, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.43,*Default,90,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose  my protective layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:29.19,*Default,91,0,0,0,,Mom, you've got ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.63,*Default,92,0,0,0,,See? Sandy doesn't fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.35,*Default,93,0,0,0,,Is she still out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:41.67,*Default,94,0,0,0,,You know she hates the cave, Grug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.23,*Default,95,0,0,0,,Please come back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:12.87,*Default,96,0,0,0,,How could she not like the cave?  It's so cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:16.19,*Default,97,0,0,0,,It is a little dark, Grug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.71,*Default,98,0,0,0,,It's not that dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:19.22,*Default,99,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.10,*Default,100,0,0,0,,Eep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:47.19,*Default,101,0,0,0,,Come on, I have to close the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.22,*Default,102,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.35,*Default,103,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.07,*Default,104,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:05.14,*Default,105,0,0,0,,Eep! Come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:24.84,*Default,106,0,0,0,,-That was too close.  -I was watching. I was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:27.23,*Default,107,0,0,0,,-What were you doing up there, Eep?  -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.03,*Default,108,0,0,0,,-What were you looking for?  -Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:30.83,*Default,109,0,0,0,,-Then why did you go up there?  -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:32.63,*Default,110,0,0,0,,Why don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.35,*Default,111,0,0,0,,Stop looking for things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:38.47,*Default,112,0,0,0,,Fear keeps us alive, Eep.  Never not be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:41.03,*Default,113,0,0,0,,What is the point of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:42.71,*Default,114,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:45.79,*Default,115,0,0,0,,Why are we here?  What are we doing this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.07,*Default,116,0,0,0,,No one said survival was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.43,*Default,117,0,0,0,,Nothing is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:54.43,*Default,118,0,0,0,,-Would you come down here?  -Grug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:55.58,*Default,119,0,0,0,,-Eep.  -Grug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:56.66,*Default,120,0,0,0,,-Yes.  -Off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:58.35,*Default,121,0,0,0,,-Yes, I know. Okay, I'm trying to...  -Off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.67,*Default,122,0,0,0,,I just don't see why  she needs her own ledge, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.71,*Default,123,0,0,0,,-That's what this is about.  -She's working through some things...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:03.94,*Default,124,0,0,0,,and she needs her own space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:06.95,*Default,125,0,0,0,,What things?  How long is this going to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.79,*Default,126,0,0,0,,Really?  She already doesn't listen to me. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.47,*Default,127,0,0,0,,See? She's listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.19,*Default,128,0,0,0,,If she wants to survive,  she has to follow our rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.63,*Default,129,0,0,0,,How about a story?  Eep loves those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.99,*Default,130,0,0,0,,That's a good ide...  How about a story, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.83,*Default,131,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell us a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.99,*Default,132,0,0,0,,Okay. Can I borrow that? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.03,*Default,133,0,0,0,,Eep, your old favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.31,*Default,134,0,0,0,,I haven't played with that thing in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:33.15,*Default,135,0,0,0,,Tonight we'll hear the story  of Krispy Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:37.35,*Default,136,0,0,0,,A long time ago,  this little bear was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:40.35,*Default,137,0,0,0,,She was alive  because she listened to her father...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:43.75,*Default,138,0,0,0,,and lived her life in routine  and darkness and terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:45.97,*Default,139,0,0,0,,So she was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:50.51,*Default,140,0,0,0,,But Krispy had one terrible problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:54.67,*Default,141,0,0,0,,She was filled with... curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.55,*Default,142,0,0,0,,-Grug.  -Yes. yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:59.87,*Default,143,0,0,0,,And one day, while she was in a tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:03.79,*Default,144,0,0,0,,the curious little bear  wanted to climb to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:06.19,*Default,145,0,0,0,,And no sooner than  she climbed to the top...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:10.19,*Default,146,0,0,0,,she saw something new and died!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:12.19,*Default,147,0,0,0,,-Just like that?  -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:16.55,*Default,148,0,0,0,,Her last moments of terror  still frozen on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:18.19,*Default,149,0,0,0,,Same ending as every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.86,*Default,150,0,0,0,,I get it, Dad. I will never do  anything new or different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:22.31,*Default,151,0,0,0,,Good man, Thunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:25.55,*Default,152,0,0,0,,All right, everyone  sharpen your teeth, and let's pile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.14,*Default,153,0,0,0,,Air.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.79,*Default,154,0,0,0,,You talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.83,*Default,155,0,0,0,,I'm a person, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.51,*Default,156,0,0,0,,Sort of like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:13.58,*Default,157,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:14.82,*Default,158,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.35,*Default,159,0,0,0,,Would you mind not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.19,*Default,160,0,0,0,,That tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:21.95,*Default,161,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:25.90,*Default,162,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:28.19,*Default,163,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:41.98,*Default,164,0,0,0,,Eep is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:43.19,*Default,165,0,0,0,,What? Grug!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:44.47,*Default,166,0,0,0,,Stay in the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.83,*Default,167,0,0,0,,Wow. You are really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.47,*Default,168,0,0,0,,Hey! No! It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.35,*Default,169,0,0,0,,-Please! Wait.  -No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.23,*Default,170,0,0,0,,-It's dying! I can fix it!  -No! I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.75,*Default,171,0,0,0,,Please! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:09.19,*Default,172,0,0,0,,I hate the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.95,*Default,173,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.55,*Default,174,0,0,0,,It does what you tell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:28.02,*Default,175,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:29.18,*Default,176,0,0,0,,The sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:32.10,*Default,177,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:35.63,*Default,178,0,0,0,,Hi, fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.47,*Default,179,0,0,0,,It's not alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:42.51,*Default,180,0,0,0,,But you said it was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:44.58,*Default,181,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:46.99,*Default,182,0,0,0,,It comes from where you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:49.23,*Default,183,0,0,0,,No. No, I make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:51.03,*Default,184,0,0,0,,-Make some for me.  -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:52.07,*Default,185,0,0,0,,Make!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:53.22,*Default,186,0,0,0,,It doesn't come out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.19,*Default,187,0,0,0,,Make! Make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:59.45,*Default,188,0,0,0,,You do this a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.04,0:20:02.87,*Default,189,0,0,0,,Are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.11,*Default,190,0,0,0,,Can I have your fire if you're dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.51,*Default,191,0,0,0,,Hey, those are cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:15.19,*Default,192,0,0,0,,You think? Listening shells, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.18,*Default,193,0,0,0,,I concur.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:19.59,*Default,194,0,0,0,,Tiger girl, we need to leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:22.03,*Default,195,0,0,0,,I don't even know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.66,*Default,196,0,0,0,,I'm Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:25.82,*Default,197,0,0,0,,Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.59,*Default,198,0,0,0,,And this is Belt.  Cook, conversationalist, navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:30.91,*Default,199,0,0,0,,Also, keeps my pants up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:32.99,*Default,200,0,0,0,,What are "pants up"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:34.47,*Default,201,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.10,*Default,202,0,0,0,,Eep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.35,*Default,203,0,0,0,,Let me clarify, Eep.  The world is ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:39.50,*Default,204,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:41.83,*Default,205,0,0,0,,I'm calling it "The End."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:46.34,*Default,206,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:47.95,*Default,207,0,0,0,,I have seen it. It's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.59,*Default,208,0,0,0,,First, the ground is going to shake.  Then it breaks open. Everything falls in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:52.90,*Default,209,0,0,0,,Fire. Lava.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.30,*Default,210,0,0,0,,I don't mean to sound too dramatic, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:00.66,*Default,211,0,0,0,,Believe me, everything we are  standing on will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:02.95,*Default,212,0,0,0,,We got to get to high ground.  I know a mountain, that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:04.79,*Default,213,0,0,0,,It's our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:06.71,*Default,214,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:11.26,*Default,215,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:12.75,*Default,216,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:15.94,*Default,217,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:22.99,*Default,218,0,0,0,,If you survive, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:29.71,*Default,219,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:31.83,*Default,220,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:33.62,*Default,221,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:36.78,*Default,222,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.51,*Default,223,0,0,0,,Are you hurt? What took you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:41.03,*Default,224,0,0,0,,Nothing. I left on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:43.47,*Default,225,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:45.75,*Default,226,0,0,0,,Dad, let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.71,*Default,227,0,0,0,,You never let me talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.71,*Default,228,0,0,0,,You're grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:01.42,*Default,229,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:04.47,*Default,230,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:05.78,*Default,231,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:07.38,*Default,232,0,0,0,,Grug! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:10.83,*Default,233,0,0,0,,You know what, I am so mad right now  that I can't talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:12.15,*Default,234,0,0,0,,Eep?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:15.31,*Default,235,0,0,0,,You will never believe it.  I found something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:16.38,*Default,236,0,0,0,,New!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:17.66,*Default,237,0,0,0,,New is a big problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:18.82,*Default,238,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.71,*Default,239,0,0,0,,Eep. Stay inside the family kill circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:22.79,*Default,240,0,0,0,,-It wasn't bad.  -"New" is always bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.35,*Default,241,0,0,0,,No. He was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:26.47,*Default,242,0,0,0,,What? Excuse me? He?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:30.63,*Default,243,0,0,0,,I thought he was a warthog,  but then he turned into a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.78,*Default,244,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:33.83,*Default,245,0,0,0,,Usually it's the reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:36.34,*Default,246,0,0,0,,Eep's got a boy hog. Eep's got a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:37.99,*Default,247,0,0,0,,There was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:40.03,*Default,248,0,0,0,,Watch. I'm going to call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:59.07,*Default,249,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:00.22,*Default,250,0,0,0,,It was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:02.27,*Default,251,0,0,0,,It was beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:04.55,*Default,252,0,0,0,,You want to see dangerous? Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:07.10,*Default,253,0,0,0,,My sniffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:08.35,*Default,254,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:09.83,*Default,255,0,0,0,,We're going back to the cave...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.51,*Default,256,0,0,0,,and you're going to stay in there  until you're older than...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:15.06,*Default,257,0,0,0,,her!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:16.22,*Default,258,0,0,0,,What!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:19.71,*Default,259,0,0,0,,You can't keep me inside forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.20,0:23:32.79,*Default,260,0,0,0,,He said this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:40.39,*Default,261,0,0,0,,Get to the cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.20,0:23:43.26,*Default,262,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.04,0:24:15.35,*Default,263,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:17.66,*Default,264,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:24:58.47,*Default,265,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:24:59.87,*Default,266,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.40,0:25:03.55,*Default,267,0,0,0,,Grug, the cave...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.72,0:25:05.35,*Default,268,0,0,0,,it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.60,0:25:08.82,*Default,269,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:47.95,*Default,270,0,0,0,,You really need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.48,0:26:05.46,*Default,271,0,0,0,,We should go there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.50,0:26:08.48,*Default,272,0,0,0,,No. No one is going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.60,0:26:13.67,*Default,273,0,0,0,,What else did that boy say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.52,0:26:39.50,*Default,274,0,0,0,,Grug?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.24,0:26:41.67,*Default,275,0,0,0,,Just go! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:42.87,*Default,276,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:06.35,*Default,277,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:11.03,*Default,278,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.79,*Default,279,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:16.11,*Default,280,0,0,0,,I don't know. I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.32,0:27:18.03,*Default,281,0,0,0,,Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.24,0:27:20.47,*Default,282,0,0,0,,In a lower place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.64,0:27:23.91,*Default,283,0,0,0,,But one thing is for sure,  we can't go back the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.36,0:27:27.59,*Default,284,0,0,0,,Sandy? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.16,0:27:31.39,*Default,285,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Wait. Come back, Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:41.39,*Default,286,0,0,0,,We can't be out in the open like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:44.91,*Default,287,0,0,0,,We need a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:47.83,*Default,288,0,0,0,,Now, step where I step.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.52,0:27:50.15,*Default,289,0,0,0,,Okay. Stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:52.78,*Default,290,0,0,0,,Hopefully, nothing big  knows we're here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.64,0:28:03.75,*Default,291,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:06.27,*Default,292,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.44,0:28:07.47,*Default,293,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.24,0:28:09.59,*Default,294,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.76,0:28:10.82,*Default,295,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:17.06,*Default,296,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.80,0:28:20.94,*Default,297,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.12,0:28:22.18,*Default,298,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.34,*Default,299,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:38.59,*Default,300,0,0,0,,So, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.96,0:28:42.50,*Default,301,0,0,0,,just to be clear, are we looking for  the exact same cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.68,0:28:45.14,*Default,302,0,0,0,,If it was me...  I'm just throwing this out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:47.70,*Default,303,0,0,0,,if it was me choosing the cave...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.44,0:28:53.03,*Default,304,0,0,0,,I would go with a smaller cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:55.54,*Default,305,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:00.42,*Default,306,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:02.43,*Default,307,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.20,0:29:13.67,*Default,308,0,0,0,,All right, Dad, get them! Go get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.24,0:29:15.59,*Default,309,0,0,0,,Now you got them right...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:16.87,*Default,310,0,0,0,,Man, they're really...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:18.39,*Default,311,0,0,0,,I'm loving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:20.34,*Default,312,0,0,0,,Dad, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.52,0:29:22.03,*Default,313,0,0,0,,Just stop running into their fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:26.16,*Default,314,0,0,0,,Grug, when you're done,  we should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.56,0:29:34.51,*Default,315,0,0,0,,That's right. You can't get past this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.63,*Default,316,0,0,0,,Climb! Climb! Climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:06.67,*Default,317,0,0,0,,Cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:07.95,*Default,318,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.36,0:30:10.71,*Default,319,0,0,0,,Come on! Hurry up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.04,0:30:15.99,*Default,320,0,0,0,,Look! This cave has a tongue. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:33.87,*Default,321,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.04,0:30:38.11,*Default,322,0,0,0,,That's one, two, three, four, five, six.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:39.99,*Default,323,0,0,0,,And seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.16,0:30:43.47,*Default,324,0,0,0,,if we're counting Chunky the Death Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:30:56.03,*Default,325,0,0,0,,It's scared of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.00,0:30:59.63,*Default,326,0,0,0,,Wait, we're scared of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.56,0:31:37.87,*Default,327,0,0,0,,Kill circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:50.45,*Default,328,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.96,0:32:10.94,*Default,329,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:12.47,*Default,330,0,0,0,,-Cavies!  -"Cavies"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.64,0:33:15.15,*Default,331,0,0,0,,Cavemen! Stand back!  They're practically animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.32,0:33:17.91,*Default,332,0,0,0,,-You see their bony, sloping foreheads?  -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:20.59,*Default,333,0,0,0,,The huge primitive teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.04,0:33:22.02,*Default,334,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:23.75,*Default,335,0,0,0,,The excessive body hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.16,0:33:25.35,*Default,336,0,0,0,,That one has got a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.48,0:33:26.46,*Default,337,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.56,0:33:29.23,*Default,338,0,0,0,,All right. Close your eyes.  I'm going to have to take their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.44,0:33:32.27,*Default,339,0,0,0,,No! It won't help.  They're my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.44,0:33:33.42,*Default,340,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:36.35,*Default,341,0,0,0,,The sun is in his hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.52,0:33:38.90,*Default,342,0,0,0,,No, no. It's "fire."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.12,0:33:40.39,*Default,343,0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.56,0:33:41.91,*Default,344,0,0,0,,He made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.12,0:33:43.10,*Default,345,0,0,0,,Make some for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.28,0:33:44.55,*Default,346,0,0,0,,It doesn't come out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.72,0:33:46.19,*Default,347,0,0,0,,Make. Make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.68,0:33:50.11,*Default,348,0,0,0,,You're a lot like your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.28,0:33:51.79,*Default,349,0,0,0,,Great, now he's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.96,0:33:53.67,*Default,350,0,0,0,,It's a baby sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.20,0:33:56.79,*Default,351,0,0,0,,Hey, stay back.  We don't know what it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:33:59.79,*Default,352,0,0,0,,Now, we'll all sit here  and wait for the sun to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.96,0:34:02.34,*Default,353,0,0,0,,And tomorrow we'll find a new cave...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.56,0:34:05.19,*Default,354,0,0,0,,and pretend today never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.36,0:34:06.63,*Default,355,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun, Eep?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.80,0:34:08.07,*Default,356,0,0,0,,Eep, don't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.24,0:34:09.55,*Default,357,0,0,0,,Goodness knows where he's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.72,0:34:11.63,*Default,358,0,0,0,,Dad, Sandy is hurting fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.32,0:34:14.62,*Default,359,0,0,0,,Sandy, no. Fire is not a plaything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:16.79,*Default,360,0,0,0,,What a cute little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.96,0:34:18.75,*Default,361,0,0,0,,Hey. Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.84,0:34:22.75,*Default,362,0,0,0,,No, no, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.76,0:34:26.95,*Default,363,0,0,0,,It likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.12,0:34:28.47,*Default,364,0,0,0,,Hey! It's biting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.52,0:34:34.03,*Default,365,0,0,0,,Thunk! Try hiding from it  in the tall, dry grass!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.60,0:34:39.80,*Default,366,0,0,0,,No, stop. Please, I'm only nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.84,0:34:40.82,*Default,367,0,0,0,,They're biting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.44,0:34:45.83,*Default,368,0,0,0,,More fire babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.20,0:34:50.31,*Default,369,0,0,0,,So, your dad, he is trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:52.27,*Default,370,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I won't let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.48,0:34:55.99,*Default,371,0,0,0,,Hold on, son. Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.56,0:34:58.99,*Default,372,0,0,0,,No, stop! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.32,0:35:02.35,*Default,373,0,0,0,,Get out! Out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.52,0:35:04.39,*Default,374,0,0,0,,Eat up, babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.24,0:35:07.07,*Default,375,0,0,0,,No, stop touching me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:09.18,*Default,376,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:13.23,*Default,377,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:22.48,*Default,378,0,0,0,,They're not so scary  once you get to know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.20,0:35:26.19,*Default,379,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.36,0:35:27.75,*Default,380,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.92,0:35:30.15,*Default,381,0,0,0,,We're the Croods!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.44,0:35:31.66,*Default,382,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.44,0:35:33.42,*Default,383,0,0,0,,Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.52,0:35:34.87,*Default,384,0,0,0,,Hi, Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.44,0:35:49.47,*Default,385,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:51.67,*Default,386,0,0,0,,It looks like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.84,0:35:54.07,*Default,387,0,0,0,,And smells like food.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.88,0:36:02.87,*Default,388,0,0,0,,No, don't eat it, it's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:08.27,*Default,389,0,0,0,,Still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.44,0:36:10.35,*Default,390,0,0,0,,Come on, keep eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.96,0:36:15.63,*Default,391,0,0,0,,Hey, where is Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:23.26,*Default,392,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.44,0:36:24.42,*Default,393,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.60,0:36:27.11,*Default,394,0,0,0,,The mountain? High ground?  End of the world, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.28,0:36:30.27,*Default,395,0,0,0,,That already happened.  It destroyed our cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.44,0:36:32.79,*Default,396,0,0,0,,No. That was just the beginning of the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:35.43,*Default,397,0,0,0,,The end of the end is still coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.71,*Default,398,0,0,0,,Eep. Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.84,0:36:42.43,*Default,399,0,0,0,,We can't let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.60,0:36:45.79,*Default,400,0,0,0,,What if we don't find a  cave before sunset?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.96,0:36:47.67,*Default,401,0,0,0,,What if it takes a few days?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.40,0:36:50.75,*Default,402,0,0,0,,What if the birds come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.32,0:36:55.31,*Default,403,0,0,0,,We need his fire, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.32,0:36:59.47,*Default,404,0,0,0,,Fine. You're staying with us  until we find a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.64,0:37:02.67,*Default,405,0,0,0,,What? No, I'm not.  Don't make me a part of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.12,0:37:04.71,*Default,406,0,0,0,,Stay here if you want, but let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:05.99,*Default,407,0,0,0,,I've got a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.20,0:37:08.23,*Default,408,0,0,0,,a mission, a reason to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.40,0:37:09.51,*Default,409,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:11.50,*Default,410,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:13.50,*Default,411,0,0,0,,Let's go to that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.64,0:37:14.62,*Default,412,0,0,0,,It's too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:17.63,*Default,413,0,0,0,,Dad really has his heart set on a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.84,0:37:21.22,*Default,414,0,0,0,,There are caves on that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:22.62,*Default,415,0,0,0,,Have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.84,0:37:23.87,*Default,416,0,0,0,,It's a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.04,0:37:26.34,*Default,417,0,0,0,,Mountains are safe.  Mountains have caves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.52,0:37:28.51,*Default,418,0,0,0,,And water. And sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.72,0:37:31.23,*Default,419,0,0,0,,Mom? Did you hear that?  I can get my own stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:33.83,*Default,420,0,0,0,,Yes. Sticks and caves.  Caves and sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.00,0:37:35.14,*Default,421,0,0,0,,Crazy sticks. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.00,0:37:37.14,*Default,422,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.72,0:37:49.11,*Default,423,0,0,0,,That thing is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.20,0:37:53.07,*Default,424,0,0,0,,No, no, no. It's okay, Sandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:54.59,*Default,425,0,0,0,,That's just Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:37:59.91,*Default,426,0,0,0,,I've made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.08,0:38:02.54,*Default,427,0,0,0,,We're going to that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.16,0:38:05.23,*Default,428,0,0,0,,Don't ask me why. Just a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.40,0:38:07.07,*Default,429,0,0,0,,Just feels right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:10.35,*Default,430,0,0,0,,I don't know, Grug.  We've never really walked that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.52,0:38:12.55,*Default,431,0,0,0,,I don't think my feet can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.72,0:38:15.35,*Default,432,0,0,0,,I'll never live long enough to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.36,0:38:17.71,*Default,433,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:20.59,*Default,434,0,0,0,,Come on, just think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.76,0:38:24.75,*Default,435,0,0,0,,Our whole family packed together  on a long, slow, trip across country?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.92,0:38:26.83,*Default,436,0,0,0,,Days and nights with just each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.00,0:38:28.71,*Default,437,0,0,0,,We'll tell stories. We'll laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.24,0:38:33.27,*Default,438,0,0,0,,We'll become closer as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:36.42,*Default,439,0,0,0,,Get her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:38.67,*Default,440,0,0,0,,If you're not ready to challenge her,  then don't look her in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:42.67,*Default,441,0,0,0,,Could you keep your big giant arms  on your side of the trail?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:45.67,*Default,442,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun?  We're taking our first trip together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.40,0:38:48.07,*Default,443,0,0,0,,Stop shoving,  or I will pull out your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.95,0:38:51.27,*Default,444,0,0,0,,Do you want me to  turn this family around? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.28,0:38:53.72,*Default,445,0,0,0,,Because I will  turn this family around so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.80,0:38:55.03,*Default,446,0,0,0,,Dad, I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.20,0:38:57.27,*Default,447,0,0,0,,-Come on, you can hold it.  -I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.48,0:38:58.62,*Default,448,0,0,0,,Sandy, take that out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:38:59.91,*Default,449,0,0,0,,I'm touching...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.08,0:39:02.54,*Default,450,0,0,0,,Dad, I still gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.72,0:39:05.55,*Default,451,0,0,0,,Fine. Just go behind one of those  lumpy things and make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.83,0:39:08.83,*Default,452,0,0,0,,-Something bit me!  -I don't blame it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.83,0:39:10.60,*Default,453,0,0,0,,Dad, can I take a turn carrying him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.60,0:39:11.58,*Default,454,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.68,0:39:13.19,*Default,455,0,0,0,,-How about now?  -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.32,0:39:14.59,*Default,456,0,0,0,,-Now?  -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.68,0:39:15.66,*Default,457,0,0,0,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.76,0:39:17.99,*Default,458,0,0,0,,I can do this all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:21.43,*Default,459,0,0,0,,No, no, no and still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:23.75,*Default,460,0,0,0,,I'm not dying on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.72,0:39:26.52,*Default,461,0,0,0,,Grug, we're all pretty tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.60,0:39:27.79,*Default,462,0,0,0,,We'll eat when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:29.39,*Default,463,0,0,0,,It's taking too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.56,0:39:31.27,*Default,464,0,0,0,,I'm grabbing a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:33.87,*Default,465,0,0,0,,Don't do that. He will cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:35.95,*Default,466,0,0,0,,That's not food, he's a pet. My pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.12,0:39:37.18,*Default,467,0,0,0,,What's a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.36,0:39:39.11,*Default,468,0,0,0,,An animal you don't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.28,0:39:41.27,*Default,469,0,0,0,,We call those "children."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:46.11,*Default,470,0,0,0,,No man should have a pet.  It's weird and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:48.79,*Default,471,0,0,0,,-It's food!  -No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.96,0:39:50.71,*Default,472,0,0,0,,Not that. That!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.32,0:39:53.79,*Default,473,0,0,0,,Food fixes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.96,0:39:55.47,*Default,474,0,0,0,,Show me your hunting face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.96,0:39:59.47,*Default,475,0,0,0,,Not you. You're still grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.64,0:40:00.95,*Default,476,0,0,0,,Come on, Thunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.12,0:40:02.75,*Default,477,0,0,0,,My feet hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.16,0:40:10.83,*Default,478,0,0,0,,-You look tense.  -I'm not tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.40,0:40:14.47,*Default,479,0,0,0,,Angry girl wants to be doing  what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.28,0:40:16.47,*Default,480,0,0,0,,I wasn't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.76,0:40:19.51,*Default,481,0,0,0,,Hang on, Thunk, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.80,0:40:21.51,*Default,482,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.80,0:40:23.99,*Default,483,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.16,0:40:25.35,*Default,484,0,0,0,,Hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.52,0:40:27.51,*Default,485,0,0,0,,Get it off! You stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:28.82,*Default,486,0,0,0,,No, seriously, what are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.00,0:40:31.99,*Default,487,0,0,0,,You've got a ton of eggs.  Just make another egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.04,0:40:49.03,*Default,488,0,0,0,,Now you're just rubbing it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:53.47,*Default,489,0,0,0,,There, who's hungry for scorpion?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.64,0:40:58.10,*Default,490,0,0,0,,What happened to the egg and the bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:40:59.86,*Default,491,0,0,0,,We lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.04,0:41:02.67,*Default,492,0,0,0,,But when the bird stepped on me  and pushed me into the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:04.91,*Default,493,0,0,0,,the scorpion grabbed a hold of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.79,0:41:07.43,*Default,494,0,0,0,,and one thing led to another  and here we are eating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.56,0:41:08.59,*Default,495,0,0,0,,So, win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:11.39,*Default,496,0,0,0,,Not enough. Not enough!  I need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.56,0:41:14.35,*Default,497,0,0,0,,I need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.47,0:41:17.27,*Default,498,0,0,0,,Look at that.  She's not going to eat me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.56,0:41:18.54,*Default,499,0,0,0,,You're too skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.72,0:41:20.75,*Default,500,0,0,0,,If she was going to eat anyone  it would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.52,0:41:22.55,*Default,501,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.64,0:41:24.23,*Default,502,0,0,0,,She's locked her jaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.40,0:41:26.19,*Default,503,0,0,0,,Get a stick! Get a stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.04,0:41:29.23,*Default,504,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.56,0:41:31.19,*Default,505,0,0,0,,You sick old monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.36,0:41:33.15,*Default,506,0,0,0,,Hurry! Put the stick in her mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.72,0:41:36.31,*Default,507,0,0,0,,Hold her still. Use a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.16,0:41:40.35,*Default,508,0,0,0,,Ugga, would you just hit her legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.48,0:41:42.75,*Default,509,0,0,0,,Why are you rolling away?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.92,0:41:44.91,*Default,510,0,0,0,,I just want something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:48.23,*Default,511,0,0,0,,You have bug for dinner. Plenty of bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.44,0:41:49.42,*Default,512,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.40,0:41:51.83,*Default,513,0,0,0,,I'll let you help me hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.00,0:41:53.06,*Default,514,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.88,0:41:56.34,*Default,515,0,0,0,,Don't wait on me. They're all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:58.03,*Default,516,0,0,0,,Tell my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.84,0:42:06.19,*Default,517,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.28,0:42:08.34,*Default,518,0,0,0,,What do you call this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.52,0:42:09.71,*Default,519,0,0,0,,A trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:11.03,*Default,520,0,0,0,,What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.20,0:42:12.18,*Default,521,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:23.11,*Default,522,0,0,0,,How long have you been alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.04,0:42:29.55,*Default,523,0,0,0,,So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.80,0:42:32.43,*Default,524,0,0,0,,How's your acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.12,0:42:59.31,*Default,525,0,0,0,,You're good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.64,0:43:05.11,*Default,526,0,0,0,,No. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.42,*Default,527,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.64,0:43:08.31,*Default,528,0,0,0,,-Yeah, that's yours.  -Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.68,0:43:10.99,*Default,529,0,0,0,,Your other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.16,0:43:13.54,*Default,530,0,0,0,,-That's my arm.  -Okay, I'm moving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.36,0:43:27.63,*Default,531,0,0,0,,It didn't step in your trapything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.80,0:43:30.23,*Default,532,0,0,0,,Yeah, I noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.52,0:43:35.63,*Default,533,0,0,0,,Where's Eep?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.24,0:43:43.79,*Default,534,0,0,0,,She's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.12,0:43:46.18,*Default,535,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.92,0:43:47.95,*Default,536,0,0,0,,Dad, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.64,0:44:01.59,*Default,537,0,0,0,,It's an avalanche of flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.52,0:44:31.51,*Default,538,0,0,0,,Looks like we won't be  having any leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.68,0:44:33.59,*Default,539,0,0,0,,What are "left overs"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:35.91,*Default,540,0,0,0,,When you have so much food to eat,  you have some left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.44,0:44:38.59,*Default,541,0,0,0,,We never have that much food.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:53.19,*Default,542,0,0,0,,Grug, how about a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.36,0:44:55.71,*Default,543,0,0,0,,That's a good idea. How about a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.24,0:44:58.15,*Default,544,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell us a story!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.84,0:45:04.35,*Default,545,0,0,0,,Once upon a time,  there was a little tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.52,0:45:07.08,*Default,546,0,0,0,,who lived in a cave with her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:08.43,*Default,547,0,0,0,,There were a lot of rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.00,0:45:12.84,*Default,548,0,0,0,,but the big, simple one  was to never leave the cave at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.72,0:45:18.51,*Default,549,0,0,0,,And the door was so heavy,  you'd think it would be easy to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.68,0:45:19.95,*Default,550,0,0,0,,So easy to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.12,0:45:21.34,*Default,551,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.16,0:45:24.43,*Default,552,0,0,0,,But, while everyone was asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.60,0:45:25.95,*Default,553,0,0,0,,she went out anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:27.59,*Default,554,0,0,0,,-No!  -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.76,0:45:30.51,*Default,555,0,0,0,,And no sooner than she did,  their cave was destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.68,0:45:33.27,*Default,556,0,0,0,,and everyone had to go  on this long, sucky walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.44,0:45:35.19,*Default,557,0,0,0,,with some weirdo they met...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.36,0:45:36.79,*Default,558,0,0,0,,and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.84,0:45:40.03,*Default,559,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.36,0:45:44.71,*Default,560,0,0,0,,I did not see that coming. Twist ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.88,0:45:46.47,*Default,561,0,0,0,,My stories never end like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.68,0:45:48.47,*Default,562,0,0,0,,Yes! Two stories in one night!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.64,0:46:01.23,*Default,563,0,0,0,,Okay. But it won't be as good as Grug's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:09.19,*Default,564,0,0,0,,Once upon a time,  there was a beautiful tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.36,0:46:12.27,*Default,565,0,0,0,,She lived in a cave  with the rest of her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.44,0:46:16.19,*Default,566,0,0,0,,Her father and mother told her,  "You may go anywhere you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.36,0:46:19.90,*Default,567,0,0,0,,"but never go near the cliff,  for you could fall."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.08,0:46:22.64,*Default,568,0,0,0,,And die. Good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.28,0:46:25.27,*Default,569,0,0,0,,But when no one was looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.48,0:46:29.78,*Default,570,0,0,0,,she'd go near the cliff...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.96,0:46:31.87,*Default,571,0,0,0,,for the closer she came to the edge...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.04,0:46:35.47,*Default,572,0,0,0,,the more she could hear,  the more she could see...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.64,0:46:37.55,*Default,573,0,0,0,,the more she could feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.76,0:46:40.95,*Default,574,0,0,0,,Finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.12,0:46:44.31,*Default,575,0,0,0,,she stood at the very edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.48,0:46:46.23,*Default,576,0,0,0,,She saw a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.40,0:46:49.47,*Default,577,0,0,0,,She leaned out to touch it...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.04,0:46:51.18,*Default,578,0,0,0,,and she slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.52,0:46:52.87,*Default,579,0,0,0,,And she fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.08,0:46:54.95,*Default,580,0,0,0,,And she flew.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.28,0:46:58.67,*Default,581,0,0,0,,Where did she fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:00.26,*Default,582,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:01.55,*Default,583,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.72,0:47:04.59,*Default,584,0,0,0,,A place with more suns in the sky  than you can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.80,0:47:06.15,*Default,585,0,0,0,,It would be so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.32,0:47:09.07,*Default,586,0,0,0,,A place not like today, or yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.24,0:47:12.03,*Default,587,0,0,0,,A place where things are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.88,0:47:15.67,*Default,588,0,0,0,,Tomorrow isn't a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.72,0:47:18.03,*Default,589,0,0,0,,You can't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.20,0:47:20.07,*Default,590,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.76,0:47:22.15,*Default,591,0,0,0,,I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.00,0:47:26.87,*Default,592,0,0,0,,That's where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.79,0:47:39.77,*Default,593,0,0,0,,We are going to shut our eyes and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.68,0:47:41.82,*Default,594,0,0,0,,And when we wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.04,0:47:44.23,*Default,595,0,0,0,,we're going to find the place  that has everything we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.40,0:47:45.43,*Default,596,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.52,0:47:46.83,*Default,597,0,0,0,,A cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.92,0:48:27.71,*Default,598,0,0,0,,That was too close. It almost caught us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.92,0:48:29.67,*Default,599,0,0,0,,I was watching. We were fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.88,0:48:30.99,*Default,600,0,0,0,,We gotta move faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.16,0:48:34.19,*Default,601,0,0,0,,Do you people have any other speed  aside from "wander"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.36,0:48:36.39,*Default,602,0,0,0,,I'll take a shamble at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.60,0:48:38.39,*Default,603,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.60,0:48:40.39,*Default,604,0,0,0,,How did the tiger fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.60,0:48:42.98,*Default,605,0,0,0,,I only share when I'm outside the log.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.16,0:48:44.51,*Default,606,0,0,0,,I'm funny that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.68,0:48:47.67,*Default,607,0,0,0,,Leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.60,0:48:49.87,*Default,608,0,0,0,,Hey, Thunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.04,0:48:51.99,*Default,609,0,0,0,,you have a spider on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:57.11,*Default,610,0,0,0,,He's loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.92,0:49:05.43,*Default,611,0,0,0,,Do not step on those weird pointy rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.60,0:49:06.87,*Default,612,0,0,0,,Do you mean these rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.04,0:49:09.87,*Default,613,0,0,0,,Do not step on these rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.04,0:49:11.75,*Default,614,0,0,0,,Step aside, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.08,0:49:17.03,*Default,615,0,0,0,,Hello? Nobody's listening!  No one is listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.20,0:49:20.03,*Default,616,0,0,0,,You cannot walk on those!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.92,0:49:34.06,*Default,617,0,0,0,,Get back here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.72,0:49:37.39,*Default,618,0,0,0,,There goes our chance for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.56,0:49:39.39,*Default,619,0,0,0,,And our log!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.40,0:49:41.38,*Default,620,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.60,0:50:04.59,*Default,621,0,0,0,,Jumping doesn't help. It does briefly...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.76,0:50:06.07,*Default,622,0,0,0,,but it doesn't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.56,0:50:12.07,*Default,623,0,0,0,,Don't walk on your hands.  The hands do not help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.64,0:50:21.11,*Default,624,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.12,0:50:24.43,*Default,625,0,0,0,,I can help you...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:27.11,*Default,626,0,0,0,,but we're going to have to  make a few changes around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.28,0:50:29.27,*Default,627,0,0,0,,The log ride is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.44,0:50:30.75,*Default,628,0,0,0,,Drop the log.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.16,0:50:37.11,*Default,629,0,0,0,,Now, kick it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.28,0:50:41.75,*Default,630,0,0,0,,Farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.48,0:50:47.62,*Default,631,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.32,0:50:51.51,*Default,632,0,0,0,,Okay, smart "Guy"...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.68,0:50:52.95,*Default,633,0,0,0,,now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.64,0:51:09.67,*Default,634,0,0,0,,Good fish, good fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.20,0:51:15.83,*Default,635,0,0,0,,Okay. Now you can look.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.12,0:51:22.63,*Default,636,0,0,0,,I love them!  Where are my feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.80,0:51:23.99,*Default,637,0,0,0,,They're still there!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:26.10,*Default,638,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.48,0:51:29.70,*Default,639,0,0,0,,You're really heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.88,0:51:30.99,*Default,640,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.16,0:51:32.30,*Default,641,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.36,0:51:34.99,*Default,642,0,0,0,,Hey. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.36,0:51:39.63,*Default,643,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:41.51,*Default,644,0,0,0,,She's up. We're good. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.68,0:51:45.30,*Default,645,0,0,0,,These shoes are great!  Where do you get these ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.32,0:51:51.39,*Default,646,0,0,0,,I'm calling it a "brain."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.56,0:51:53.86,*Default,647,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's  where ideas come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.04,0:51:57.07,*Default,648,0,0,0,,Dad, I don't have a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.36,0:52:00.51,*Default,649,0,0,0,,We've gotten along just fine  without brains until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.72,0:52:03.87,*Default,650,0,0,0,,Cavemen don't need brains.  We have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:08.31,*Default,651,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about!  Ideas are for weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.52,0:52:10.71,*Default,652,0,0,0,,Now, let's get to that mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.88,0:52:16.03,*Default,653,0,0,0,,Wow! I love those!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.20,0:52:18.39,*Default,654,0,0,0,,Good fish. Don't eat my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.99,0:52:58.28,*Default,655,0,0,0,,So, how did the tiger fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:53:00.03,*Default,656,0,0,0,,She jumped on the sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.20,0:53:01.91,*Default,657,0,0,0,,and rode it to Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.88,0:53:05.87,*Default,658,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.52,0:53:39.50,*Default,659,0,0,0,,Hi, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.84,0:53:42.47,*Default,660,0,0,0,,Bye, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.32,0:53:49.83,*Default,661,0,0,0,,You've seen rain before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.00,0:53:52.27,*Default,662,0,0,0,,We don't get out much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.32,0:54:14.83,*Default,663,0,0,0,,Eep, looks dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.80,0:54:18.03,*Default,664,0,0,0,,Dad, you say that about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.20,0:54:19.18,*Default,665,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.40,0:54:20.67,*Default,666,0,0,0,,Really? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.88,0:54:57.71,*Default,667,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.24,0:55:22.07,*Default,668,0,0,0,,So, the bear says, "Your cave? I've been  dumping my bones here since last week."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.28,0:55:23.39,*Default,669,0,0,0,,Last week!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.36,0:55:25.87,*Default,670,0,0,0,,That's a funny story!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.04,0:55:28.11,*Default,671,0,0,0,,It's not a story. It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.28,0:55:29.55,*Default,672,0,0,0,,What's a "joke"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.76,0:55:32.75,*Default,673,0,0,0,,Just making something up  to make you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:39.10,*Default,674,0,0,0,,-One for you.  -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.28,0:55:42.23,*Default,675,0,0,0,,One for you. And this one's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.96,0:55:43.94,*Default,676,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.12,0:55:45.95,*Default,677,0,0,0,,Okay! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.44,0:55:49.43,*Default,678,0,0,0,,I don't see why the kids  need their own shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.60,0:55:51.63,*Default,679,0,0,0,,So if anyone gets in trouble,  we can call the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:54.59,*Default,680,0,0,0,,Wait, you're saying we should split up?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.76,0:55:56.19,*Default,681,0,0,0,,We can try more paths at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.19,0:55:57.90,*Default,682,0,0,0,,It's the fastest way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.92,0:56:00.43,*Default,683,0,0,0,,Croods stick together.  Your way isn't safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.60,0:56:01.58,*Default,684,0,0,0,,They can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.76,0:56:02.98,*Default,685,0,0,0,,We can do it, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.16,0:56:04.75,*Default,686,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.96,0:56:06.95,*Default,687,0,0,0,,It's my job to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.99,0:56:09.88,*Default,688,0,0,0,,I'm still in charge  and we are not splitting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.12,0:56:12.23,*Default,689,0,0,0,,Except for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.96,0:56:14.27,*Default,690,0,0,0,,And that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.96,0:56:35.59,*Default,691,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.76,0:56:37.71,*Default,692,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.88,0:56:39.15,*Default,693,0,0,0,,We're okay, Grug.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.32,0:56:41.39,*Default,694,0,0,0,,Dad? I'm freaking out a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.56,0:56:44.12,*Default,695,0,0,0,,Just tell me what to do.  What do I do? What do I do right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.28,0:56:46.15,*Default,696,0,0,0,,Stay where you are. I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.32,0:56:47.91,*Default,697,0,0,0,,No. Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.08,0:56:50.99,*Default,698,0,0,0,,Everybody, keep moving forward  and we'll get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.16,0:56:52.14,*Default,699,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.16,0:56:55.67,*Default,700,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.84,0:56:57.19,*Default,701,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.36,0:56:59.82,*Default,702,0,0,0,,Remember, never not be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:01.87,*Default,703,0,0,0,,You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.04,0:57:04.19,*Default,704,0,0,0,,It's going to be okay,  it's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.36,0:57:06.51,*Default,705,0,0,0,,I'm going to pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.20,0:57:10.11,*Default,706,0,0,0,,Sandy. Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.84,0:59:01.43,*Default,707,0,0,0,,Give me another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.04,0:59:06.39,*Default,708,0,0,0,,You dropped these.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.04,0:59:41.55,*Default,709,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.48,0:59:46.15,*Default,710,0,0,0,,Here, boy! Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.08,0:59:51.30,*Default,711,0,0,0,,Gran?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.88,0:59:54.86,*Default,712,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.04,0:59:56.51,*Default,713,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.04,0:59:59.43,*Default,714,0,0,0,,Grug?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.36,1:00:09.03,*Default,715,0,0,0,,I'll go get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.28,1:00:17.51,*Default,716,0,0,0,,Good boy! Who's a good boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.68,1:00:19.71,*Default,717,0,0,0,,You are! Yes, you are! Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.88,1:00:21.67,*Default,718,0,0,0,,You need a name. You want a name?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.84,1:00:23.51,*Default,719,0,0,0,,I'm going to call you Douglas.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.72,1:00:25.99,*Default,720,0,0,0,,Can you do tricks? Roll over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.16,1:00:28.03,*Default,721,0,0,0,,Come on, Douglas, roll over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.68,1:00:35.65,*Default,722,0,0,0,,Good boy, Douglas!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.72,1:00:40.35,*Default,723,0,0,0,,I was in love once.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.52,1:00:43.35,*Default,724,0,0,0,,He was a hunter. I was a gatherer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.52,1:00:45.90,*Default,725,0,0,0,,It was quite a scandal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.72,1:00:50.07,*Default,726,0,0,0,,We fed each other berries, we danced.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.24,1:00:53.55,*Default,727,0,0,0,,Then my father smashed him with a rock  and traded me to your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:00:59.95,*Default,728,0,0,0,,Croods!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.12,1:01:01.39,*Default,729,0,0,0,,Get down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.56,1:01:04.35,*Default,730,0,0,0,,Grug, they're okay. Guy is with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.92,1:01:07.11,*Default,731,0,0,0,,Guy is with them. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.64,1:01:08.70,*Default,732,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.88,1:01:12.75,*Default,733,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me  that interesting Guy update.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.20,1:01:14.87,*Default,734,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm going to go up...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.04,1:01:19.71,*Default,735,0,0,0,,and why don't you join us  when you stop being a big drag!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.92,1:01:29.47,*Default,736,0,0,0,,Sleep pile?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.72,1:01:35.47,*Default,737,0,0,0,,How about a story?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.12,1:01:39.43,*Default,738,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.00,1:01:46.07,*Default,739,0,0,0,,And then Torg said,  "Know it? I drew it."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.80,1:01:49.63,*Default,740,0,0,0,,That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.40,1:01:54.47,*Default,741,0,0,0,,I know it was hard for you  to bring us along...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.64,1:01:57.51,*Default,742,0,0,0,,but they had the  best day of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.84,1:02:01.30,*Default,743,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.60,1:02:26.16,*Default,744,0,0,0,,I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.64,1:03:08.87,*Default,745,0,0,0,,More suns in the sky than you can count.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.68,1:03:13.71,*Default,746,0,0,0,,Every sun that crosses our sky  comes to rest up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.88,1:03:15.31,*Default,747,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.31,1:03:17.51,*Default,748,0,0,0,,That's where we'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.56,1:03:20.39,*Default,749,0,0,0,,I'm going with Guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.72,1:03:23.23,*Default,750,0,0,0,,No. Not my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.60,1:03:29.35,*Default,751,0,0,0,,Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.72,1:03:31.23,*Default,752,0,0,0,,I can't go without Grug.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.97,1:03:34.20,*Default,753,0,0,0,,That makes one of us. Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.24,1:03:35.87,*Default,754,0,0,0,,Really, Mom? Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.08,1:03:38.27,*Default,755,0,0,0,,Grug has no idea how to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.44,1:03:40.55,*Default,756,0,0,0,,In fact, he has no ideas at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.72,1:03:43.71,*Default,757,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.  What about that one time when he...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.92,1:03:47.19,*Default,758,0,0,0,,Face it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.36,1:03:50.39,*Default,759,0,0,0,,If he actually had an idea of his own...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.56,1:03:52.75,*Default,760,0,0,0,,I'd have a heart attack and die!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.24,1:03:59.22,*Default,761,0,0,0,,Grug?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.36,1:04:00.55,*Default,762,0,0,0,,-Dad!  -Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.40,1:04:04.64,*Default,763,0,0,0,,He's a big guy. How could he  just disappear like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.88,1:04:08.02,*Default,764,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Let's ask that ugly lady  if she's seen Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.80,1:04:10.11,*Default,765,0,0,0,,Haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.04,1:04:12.63,*Default,766,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.88,1:04:17.58,*Default,767,0,0,0,,I was up all night, because  all these ideas just kept coming to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.76,1:04:19.39,*Default,768,0,0,0,,Is that a snake?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.56,1:04:21.59,*Default,769,0,0,0,,Belt, new and improved.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.48,1:04:26.07,*Default,770,0,0,0,,It's even self-tightening!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.24,1:04:28.95,*Default,771,0,0,0,,What is that on your head?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.12,1:04:31.07,*Default,772,0,0,0,,It's called desperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.24,1:04:33.62,*Default,773,0,0,0,,I call it a "rug." Rhymes with "Grug."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.80,1:04:36.79,*Default,774,0,0,0,,And this one, I call it a "ride."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.96,1:04:38.10,*Default,775,0,0,0,,Rhymes with "Grug."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.28,1:04:39.26,*Default,776,0,0,0,,That doesn't rhyme...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.44,1:04:41.79,*Default,777,0,0,0,,It's going to get us  places faster than shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.60,1:04:44.47,*Default,778,0,0,0,,Yeah! Try to keep up!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.64,1:04:52.47,*Default,779,0,0,0,,I wish I had a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.68,1:04:55.19,*Default,780,0,0,0,,And painting is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.36,1:04:57.79,*Default,781,0,0,0,,I call this a "snapshot."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.96,1:05:01.19,*Default,782,0,0,0,,Let's do it again. I think I blinked.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.48,1:05:04.75,*Default,783,0,0,0,,I call them "shades."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.96,1:05:06.87,*Default,784,0,0,0,,The sun doesn't hurt my eyes anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.04,1:05:08.83,*Default,785,0,0,0,,Where do you get these great ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:10.27,*Default,786,0,0,0,,Since I don't have a brain...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.44,1:05:12.82,*Default,787,0,0,0,,they're coming from my stomach,  down deep below...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.00,1:05:15.15,*Default,788,0,0,0,,and then up again into my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.00,1:05:19.99,*Default,789,0,0,0,,Grug, we have to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.32,1:05:22.95,*Default,790,0,0,0,,See, I got ideas. I got thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.12,1:05:26.11,*Default,791,0,0,0,,Like this. I call it a "mobile home."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.28,1:05:27.99,*Default,792,0,0,0,,Isn't that something?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.04,1:05:33.63,*Default,793,0,0,0,,And I'm calling this one a "lifterator."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.72,1:05:34.70,*Default,794,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.80,1:05:35.94,*Default,795,0,0,0,,I know. It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.04,1:05:42.15,*Default,796,0,0,0,,I almost feel sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.00,1:05:48.51,*Default,797,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.36,1:05:51.35,*Default,798,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do, Grug?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.52,1:05:55.51,*Default,799,0,0,0,,See, I thought if I could have ideas...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.84,1:05:57.15,*Default,800,0,0,0,,Iike Guy...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.04,1:06:00.15,*Default,801,0,0,0,,maybe Eep would listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.32,1:06:04.02,*Default,802,0,0,0,,And maybe she wouldn't  want to go with Guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.20,1:06:05.55,*Default,803,0,0,0,,Grug.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.72,1:06:08.18,*Default,804,0,0,0,,Is that what this is all about?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.56,1:06:14.75,*Default,805,0,0,0,,And I also thought  it would kill your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.92,1:06:17.38,*Default,806,0,0,0,,So win-win.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.56,1:06:18.99,*Default,807,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.60,1:06:58.55,*Default,808,0,0,0,,Cave!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.64,1:06:59.62,*Default,809,0,0,0,,Everyone inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.80,1:07:00.91,*Default,810,0,0,0,,Hurry up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.12,1:07:02.31,*Default,811,0,0,0,,Let's go. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.60,1:07:05.71,*Default,812,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.44,1:07:09.95,*Default,813,0,0,0,,No more caves, Grug.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.12,1:07:11.15,*Default,814,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.24,1:07:14.91,*Default,815,0,0,0,,We're going to jump on the sun  and ride it to Tomorrow with Guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.08,1:07:17.38,*Default,816,0,0,0,,Wait. So you're all going to do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.12,1:07:20.15,*Default,817,0,0,0,,Thunk?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.68,1:07:23.15,*Default,818,0,0,0,,Sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.96,1:07:27.26,*Default,819,0,0,0,,You have to stop worrying for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.48,1:07:30.15,*Default,820,0,0,0,,It's my job to worry!  It's my job to follow the rules!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.32,1:07:32.15,*Default,821,0,0,0,,The rules don't work out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.36,1:07:33.50,*Default,822,0,0,0,,They kept us alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.68,1:07:37.75,*Default,823,0,0,0,,That wasn't living!  That was just not dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.92,1:07:39.27,*Default,824,0,0,0,,There's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.44,1:07:41.95,*Default,825,0,0,0,,Ugga, everyone,  you have to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.16,1:07:45.19,*Default,826,0,0,0,,We would be dead if we listened to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.76,1:07:48.75,*Default,827,0,0,0,,We have to follow Guy now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.20,1:07:54.18,*Default,828,0,0,0,,Guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.96,1:07:56.35,*Default,829,0,0,0,,Guy? Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.16,1:08:07.30,*Default,830,0,0,0,,This is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.52,1:08:09.27,*Default,831,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.  Everything is collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.30,1:08:11.82,*Default,832,0,0,0,,You're being irrational  and counterproductive!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.85,1:08:12.99,*Default,833,0,0,0,,Big words anger me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.56,1:08:14.70,*Default,834,0,0,0,,Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.88,1:08:16.10,*Default,835,0,0,0,,Countermeasures!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.20,1:08:19.87,*Default,836,0,0,0,,You remember how you were  this morning? You changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.04,1:08:21.79,*Default,837,0,0,0,,Idea man. Modern man.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.52,1:08:25.51,*Default,838,0,0,0,,I am a caveman!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.68,1:08:26.87,*Default,839,0,0,0,,No, no, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.24,1:08:49.27,*Default,840,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:52.35,*Default,841,0,0,0,,What is this stuff that saves you  from my punches?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.72,1:08:54.75,*Default,842,0,0,0,,Tar.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.84,1:08:57.19,*Default,843,0,0,0,,No. I have to get back to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.92,1:08:59.03,*Default,844,0,0,0,,Stop struggling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.12,1:09:00.10,*Default,845,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.24,1:09:01.22,*Default,846,0,0,0,,Grug, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.20,1:09:10.55,*Default,847,0,0,0,,No one gets out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.60,1:09:13.55,*Default,848,0,0,0,,Believe me...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.54,*Default,849,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.40,1:09:17.38,*Default,850,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.56,1:09:20.23,*Default,851,0,0,0,,Family. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.36,1:09:27.95,*Default,852,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.24,1:09:33.75,*Default,853,0,0,0,,I was little when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.76,1:09:37.19,*Default,854,0,0,0,,Last thing my parents told me was...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.40,1:09:38.71,*Default,855,0,0,0,,"Don't hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.60,1:09:41.07,*Default,856,0,0,0,,"Live.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.92,1:09:45.27,*Default,857,0,0,0,,"Follow the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.44,1:09:47.55,*Default,858,0,0,0,,"You'll make it to Tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.92,1:09:51.91,*Default,859,0,0,0,,You followed the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.72,1:09:54.71,*Default,860,0,0,0,,My daughter is a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.88,1:09:55.91,*Default,861,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.08,1:09:57.59,*Default,862,0,0,0,,She's like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.76,1:10:00.79,*Default,863,0,0,0,,She loves you,  but always forgets to say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.96,1:10:03.47,*Default,864,0,0,0,,Just like you forget to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.56,1:10:11.68,*Default,865,0,0,0,,I guess I was just busy  keeping them all alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.08,1:10:15.59,*Default,866,0,0,0,,It's okay. That's what dads do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.28,1:10:25.07,*Default,867,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.28,1:10:27.47,*Default,868,0,0,0,,But we can't do that from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.64,1:10:30.31,*Default,869,0,0,0,,We need one of your ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.16,1:10:35.99,*Default,870,0,0,0,,Come on. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.32,1:10:43.31,*Default,871,0,0,0,,Belt! Emergency Idea Generator, activate!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.00,1:10:47.11,*Default,872,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:54.22,*Default,873,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.32,1:10:57.27,*Default,874,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. But he's doing  the best with what he has.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.48,1:10:58.62,*Default,875,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.00,1:11:05.67,*Default,876,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.84,1:11:08.55,*Default,877,0,0,0,,Belt, I want romance, drama, sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.72,1:11:09.70,*Default,878,0,0,0,,Move me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.84,1:11:17.19,*Default,879,0,0,0,,Okay, he sees us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.36,1:11:19.66,*Default,880,0,0,0,,That's our cue. Now, work it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.00,1:11:30.22,*Default,881,0,0,0,,He's not coming over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.40,1:11:32.03,*Default,882,0,0,0,,I don't think our puppet  looks scared enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.20,1:11:34.55,*Default,883,0,0,0,,Scared? I'll show you scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.72,1:11:36.31,*Default,884,0,0,0,,Hand me those acting sticks!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.72,1:11:54.39,*Default,885,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.12,1:12:26.11,*Default,886,0,0,0,,Yes! You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:28.18,*Default,887,0,0,0,,-Grug!  -Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.40,1:12:30.59,*Default,888,0,0,0,,Hey! We're okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.08,1:12:34.43,*Default,889,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.44,1:12:36.91,*Default,890,0,0,0,,We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.80,1:12:51.43,*Default,891,0,0,0,,Grug, your call.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.60,1:12:54.55,*Default,892,0,0,0,,Take us to Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.84,1:13:01.95,*Default,893,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.12,1:13:04.31,*Default,894,0,0,0,,Come on! We're going to make it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.96,1:13:07.51,*Default,895,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.68,1:13:10.11,*Default,896,0,0,0,,There it is! The sun!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.32,1:13:13.47,*Default,897,0,0,0,,We can do it!  We can ride it to Tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.48,1:13:38.62,*Default,898,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.72,1:14:09.02,*Default,899,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.20,1:14:12.23,*Default,900,0,0,0,,The sun was right here.  It was right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.88,1:14:18.47,*Default,901,0,0,0,,We have to go back to the cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.68,1:14:20.03,*Default,902,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.34,1:14:23.36,*Default,903,0,0,0,,Stay together. Let's keep moving.  Move, move, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.56,1:14:24.99,*Default,904,0,0,0,,Everybody, hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.16,1:14:27.75,*Default,905,0,0,0,,Thunk, let's go. Go, go, go.  Let's stay together.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.92,1:14:31.03,*Default,906,0,0,0,,Grug. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.20,1:14:34.27,*Default,907,0,0,0,,Grug, we'll die if we stay here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.92,1:15:00.03,*Default,908,0,0,0,,Grug, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.20,1:15:02.87,*Default,909,0,0,0,,We've got to get back to that cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.24,1:15:08.19,*Default,910,0,0,0,,No more dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.92,1:15:11.11,*Default,911,0,0,0,,No more hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.64,1:15:13.59,*Default,912,0,0,0,,No more caves.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.28,1:15:17.27,*Default,913,0,0,0,,What's the point of all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.40,1:15:23.75,*Default,914,0,0,0,,To follow the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.44,1:15:29.11,*Default,915,0,0,0,,I can't change.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.28,1:15:31.43,*Default,916,0,0,0,,I don't have ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.28,1:15:34.55,*Default,917,0,0,0,,But I have my strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.72,1:15:36.07,*Default,918,0,0,0,,And right now...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.24,1:15:38.54,*Default,919,0,0,0,,that's all you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.28,1:15:42.84,*Default,920,0,0,0,,No, we don't know what's over there.  Maybe nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.00,1:15:44.95,*Default,921,0,0,0,,It's too risky!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.16,1:15:48.47,*Default,922,0,0,0,,It's a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.12,1:16:00.27,*Default,923,0,0,0,,I'll take that chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.68,1:16:05.63,*Default,924,0,0,0,,I've wanted to throw you away  ever since I met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.76,1:16:08.63,*Default,925,0,0,0,,That's a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.80,1:16:10.67,*Default,926,0,0,0,,What's a "joke"?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.04,1:16:42.59,*Default,927,0,0,0,,He made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.36,1:16:46.74,*Default,928,0,0,0,,He made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.72,1:16:51.95,*Default,929,0,0,0,,Okay, Thunk. Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.12,1:16:53.63,*Default,930,0,0,0,,You're not coming, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.16,1:16:56.62,*Default,931,0,0,0,,When you make it, so will I.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.96,1:17:05.94,*Default,932,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.56,1:17:16.19,*Default,933,0,0,0,,You did good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.64,1:17:20.03,*Default,934,0,0,0,,Dadda!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.20,1:17:33.18,*Default,935,0,0,0,,Gran...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.36,1:17:35.51,*Default,936,0,0,0,,No mush. Just throw me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.28,1:17:37.42,*Default,937,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.60,1:17:40.19,*Default,938,0,0,0,,You surprised me today...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.36,1:17:41.79,*Default,939,0,0,0,,Iunkhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.52,1:17:49.79,*Default,940,0,0,0,,Still alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.76,1:17:52.03,*Default,941,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.20,1:17:53.26,*Default,942,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.48,1:17:55.51,*Default,943,0,0,0,,I have too much to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.68,1:17:58.11,*Default,944,0,0,0,,I need to fix everything,  and I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.28,1:17:59.95,*Default,945,0,0,0,,I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.72,1:18:05.23,*Default,946,0,0,0,,This works good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.72,1:18:08.23,*Default,947,0,0,0,,What do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.08,1:18:12.39,*Default,948,0,0,0,,I was thinking of calling it a "hug."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.52,1:18:15.43,*Default,949,0,0,0,,Because it rhymes with "Grug."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.56,1:18:19.71,*Default,950,0,0,0,,But you can change it if you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.68,1:18:23.63,*Default,951,0,0,0,,No. I like "hug."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.52,1:18:30.87,*Default,952,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.60,1:18:35.58,*Default,953,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.20,1:18:42.63,*Default,954,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.44,1:18:45.11,*Default,955,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.32,1:18:47.75,*Default,956,0,0,0,,Never be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.40,1:19:26.51,*Default,957,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.68,1:19:27.95,*Default,958,0,0,0,,I see him!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.76,1:20:13.74,*Default,959,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.92,1:20:15.31,*Default,960,0,0,0,,Hey, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.12,1:21:38.95,*Default,961,0,0,0,,Back! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.16,1:21:40.99,*Default,962,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.40,1:22:26.99,*Default,963,0,0,0,,They're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.16,1:22:29.46,*Default,964,0,0,0,,Hang on, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.92,1:22:31.63,*Default,965,0,0,0,,How do I get across?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.84,1:22:34.95,*Default,966,0,0,0,,I have to think. What would Guy do?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.12,1:22:37.83,*Default,967,0,0,0,,What would Guy do, what would Guy do?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.04,1:22:41.95,*Default,968,0,0,0,,What would I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:44.27,*Default,969,0,0,0,,Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.68,1:23:03.11,*Default,970,0,0,0,,I have...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.36,1:23:07.95,*Default,971,0,0,0,,an idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.52,1:23:29.66,*Default,972,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.84,1:24:12.19,*Default,973,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.68,1:24:20.82,*Default,974,0,0,0,,Douglas?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.36,1:24:23.03,*Default,975,0,0,0,,Hey, I know that guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.32,1:24:59.91,*Default,976,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.84,1:25:44.43,*Default,977,0,0,0,,It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.48,1:25:48.11,*Default,978,0,0,0,,I'll tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.28,1:26:38.07,*Default,979,0,0,0,,I never got to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.12,1:26:43.15,*Default,980,0,0,0,,Eep, if your dad were here,  he would tell you to...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.32,1:26:46.39,*Default,981,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.56,1:26:48.71,*Default,982,0,0,0,,Wow. You sound just like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.88,1:26:52.63,*Default,983,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.88,1:26:53.99,*Default,984,0,0,0,,Dadda!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.16,1:26:55.38,*Default,985,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.60,1:26:56.99,*Default,986,0,0,0,,He's riding the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.38,1:27:00.38,*Default,987,0,0,0,,But, not very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.44,1:27:02.55,*Default,988,0,0,0,,Everybody out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.80,1:27:09.15,*Default,989,0,0,0,,-Dad!  -Grug!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.20,1:27:12.15,*Default,990,0,0,0,,Where's the danger?  Who blew their shell?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.96,1:27:15.87,*Default,991,0,0,0,,I love you, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.00,1:27:27.87,*Default,992,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.04,1:27:29.55,*Default,993,0,0,0,,five...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.76,1:27:30.74,*Default,994,0,0,0,,six...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.84,1:27:33.91,*Default,995,0,0,0,,and seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.52,1:27:37.71,*Default,996,0,0,0,,And a half.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.00,1:27:40.51,*Default,997,0,0,0,,And eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.40,1:27:42.38,*Default,998,0,0,0,,Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.56,1:27:44.67,*Default,999,0,0,0,,Douglas! Dad, you saved him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.84,1:27:47.27,*Default,1000,0,0,0,,A boy has to have a pet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.40,1:27:53.83,*Default,1001,0,0,0,,Turns out I'm a cat person.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.40,1:27:57.54,*Default,1002,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.60,1:28:09.87,*Default,1003,0,0,0,,You really need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.76,1:28:23.43,*Default,1004,0,0,0,,We should go there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.96,1:28:26.03,*Default,1005,0,0,0,,Yes! Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.56,1:28:30.54,*Default,1006,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.92,1:28:37.87,*Default,1007,0,0,0,,This is me. My name is Eep.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.08,1:28:41.27,*Default,1008,0,0,0,,And this is my family, the Croods.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.44,1:28:43.79,*Default,1009,0,0,0,,If you weren't clued in  by the suntans and pets...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.00,1:28:46.63,*Default,1010,0,0,0,,we're not exactly cavemen anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.00,1:28:52.67,*Default,1011,0,0,0,,Let's do it again. I think I blinked.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.32,1:28:56.23,*Default,1012,0,0,0,,Our world is still plenty harsh and hostile...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.68,1:28:59.79,*Default,1013,0,0,0,,but now we know the Croods will make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.96,1:29:02.75,*Default,1014,0,0,0,,Because we changed the rules...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.92,1:29:04.75,*Default,1015,0,0,0,,the ones that kept us in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.76,1:29:11.67,*Default,1016,0,0,0,,And because of my dad,  who taught us that anyone can change.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.84,1:29:13.51,*Default,1017,0,0,0,,Release the baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.80,1:29:20.19,*Default,1018,0,0,0,,Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.00,1:29:42.27,*Default,1019,0,0,0,,So, from now on,we'll stay out here...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.48,1:29:44.55,*Default,1020,0,0,0,,where we can follow the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:58.67,*Default,2,0,0,0,,每次日出都意味着新的一天，新的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:01:02.31,*Default,3,0,0,0,,希望今天会比昨天更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.15,*Default,4,0,0,0,,但对于我来说不是，我叫伊普
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:09.43,*Default,5,0,0,0,,这是我的家人，我们是克鲁一家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:12.86,*Default,6,0,0,0,,如果你还没从我们的兽皮外衣和倾奇的前额
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:15.67,*Default,7,0,0,0,,发现我们是谁的话，告诉你，我们是洞穴人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:19.99,*Default,8,0,0,0,,我们大多宅在洞穴里，宅在黑暗里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:24.67,*Default,9,0,0,0,,日复一日，夜复一夜地宅着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.84,0:01:28.87,*Default,10,0,0,0,,对，温馨的家哪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:31.11,*Default,11,0,0,0,,一旦有机会出去，我们就想方设法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.11,0:01:33.83,*Default,12,0,0,0,,在充满危险的世界中寻找食物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:38.78,*Default,13,0,0,0,,我则绞尽脑汁独自逃生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:42.95,*Default,14,0,0,0,,我们是最后的洞穴人了，曾经有其他的洞穴人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:45.67,*Default,15,0,0,0,,高姿一家，被猛犸象一脚踩成肉泥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.79,*Default,16,0,0,0,,霍克一家，被沙蛇一口吞进肚里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.19,*Default,17,0,0,0,,尔福一家，被蚊子活活咬死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:55.03,*Default,18,0,0,0,,斯洛格一家，得个感冒就能死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:57.95,*Default,19,0,0,0,,克鲁一家…就是我们啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:01.79,*Default,20,0,0,0,,我们活下来全靠我那爹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:05.55,*Default,21,0,0,0,,他死壮死壮的，特别循规蹈矩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.51,*Default,22,0,0,0,,就是我们洞穴墙上的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:10.19,*Default,23,0,0,0,,任何新事物都是不好的，好奇是不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.70,*Default,24,0,0,0,,晚上外出是不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.70,0:02:14.67,*Default,25,0,0,0,,基本上任何有意思的事都是不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.83,*Default,26,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的苦逼世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:19.40,*Default,27,0,0,0,,但这故事要说的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.40,0:02:22.39,*Default,28,0,0,0,,那一切怎样在瞬间全改变了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:25.80,*Default,29,0,0,0,,因为我们不知道我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.39,*Default,30,0,0,0,,马上就要玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:33.83,*Default,31,0,0,0,,墙上可没有规矩教我们如何应付这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.95,*Default,32,0,0,0,,你应该等我信号再出来的，小伊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.19,*Default,33,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.59,*Default,34,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.95,*Default,35,0,0,0,,我们都在那破山洞里呆一万年了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.42,*Default,36,0,0,0,,三天可不是一万年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.03,*Default,37,0,0,0,,对于这个家就是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:20.59,*Default,38,0,0,0,,小伊，给我下来呗？你太…招摇过市了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:24.47,*Default,39,0,0,0,,不，小沙，回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.51,*Default,40,0,0,0,,记住等信号，好姑娘都会等信号的，阿加！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.27,*Default,41,0,0,0,,抓住小沙我就回去，你就可以发信号了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.11,*Default,42,0,0,0,,不，但你们早出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.95,*Default,43,0,0,0,,我在等你信号的，爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.31,*Default,44,0,0,0,,没事了，桑克，出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:41.10,*Default,45,0,0,0,,但你要是不给我信号，我咋知道你是我爹？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:42.95,*Default,46,0,0,0,,信号不是让你知道是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:45.95,*Default,47,0,0,0,,而是让你知道我没被动物吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.10,*Default,48,0,0,0,,那为什么信号是动物的声音呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:50.03,*Default,49,0,0,0,,我是说这难道不会使人产生误会？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.55,*Default,50,0,0,0,,我还在等信号！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:15.07,*Default,51,0,0,0,,妈妈，我们可以走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:17.43,*Default,52,0,0,0,,妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:21.87,*Default,53,0,0,0,,还没死呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.43,*Default,54,0,0,0,,还太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:26.31,*Default,55,0,0,0,,你还这么肥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.63,*Default,56,0,0,0,,排成早餐队形！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:33.23,*Default,57,0,0,0,,给我拿出点洞穴人的样子来！动作要快！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:36.07,*Default,58,0,0,0,,声音要响，团结一致
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.63,*Default,59,0,0,0,,学会害怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:42.84,*Default,60,0,0,0,,《疯狂原始人》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.43,*Default,61,0,0,0,,耶…早餐耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:17.54,*Default,62,0,0,0,,该谁了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.59,*Default,63,0,0,0,,投姥姥决定，扔上去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.63,*Default,64,0,0,0,,正面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:26.55,*Default,65,0,0,0,,反面，桑克上，就位！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.83,*Default,66,0,0,0,,好，桑克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.39,*Default,67,0,0,0,,去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.23,*Default,68,0,0,0,,快去，桑克！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.55,*Default,69,0,0,0,,太棒了！把它带回洞里！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.03,*Default,70,0,0,0,,放孩子咬它！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:50.23,*Default,71,0,0,0,,去吧，小沙，去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.87,*Default,72,0,0,0,,抓住他们，妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:46.27,*Default,73,0,0,0,,老太太失手！小伊，替我报仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.02,*Default,74,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.51,*Default,75,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.39,*Default,76,0,0,0,,接好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.07,*Default,77,0,0,0,,爸爸，现在可以吃了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.27,*Default,78,0,0,0,,回家再吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.63,*Default,79,0,0,0,,小伊，过来踩煞车！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.06,*Default,80,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:38.67,*Default,81,0,0,0,,-谁想吃？  -干得好，爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:41.27,*Default,82,0,0,0,,给你，桑克，喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:46.43,*Default,83,0,0,0,,-对不起，爸爸  -看来得吃“快餐”了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:04.95,*Default,84,0,0,0,,没事儿，我上周吃过了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.15,*Default,85,0,0,0,,两指节征兆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.82,*Default,86,0,0,0,,快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:19.11,*Default,87,0,0,0,,快点，快点，黑暗会带来死亡！洞穴人都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:22.46,*Default,88,0,0,0,,月圆之夜，该洗澡喽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:25.02,*Default,89,0,0,0,,-逃命去！  -休想跑，妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.43,*Default,90,0,0,0,,我不想丢掉保护层！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:29.19,*Default,91,0,0,0,,妈妈，你都生蚂蚁了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.63,*Default,92,0,0,0,,看，小沙都不跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.35,*Default,93,0,0,0,,她还在外面？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:41.67,*Default,94,0,0,0,,你知道她讨厌呆在洞里，古勒格
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.23,*Default,95,0,0,0,,明天还要来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:12.87,*Default,96,0,0,0,,她怎么能不爱洞穴呢？这么温馨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:16.19,*Default,97,0,0,0,,有点黑，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.71,*Default,98,0,0,0,,没那么黑啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:19.22,*Default,99,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.10,*Default,100,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:47.19,*Default,101,0,0,0,,快点，我要关门了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.22,*Default,102,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.35,*Default,103,0,0,0,,知道啦，来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.07,*Default,104,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:05.14,*Default,105,0,0,0,,小伊，下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:24.84,*Default,106,0,0,0,,-太险了！  -我看着呢，我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:27.23,*Default,107,0,0,0,,-你去上面干什么，小伊？  -不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.03,*Default,108,0,0,0,,-你去找什么？  -没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:30.83,*Default,109,0,0,0,,-那你为什么上去？  -不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:32.63,*Default,110,0,0,0,,为什么不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.35,*Default,111,0,0,0,,别找东西了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:38.47,*Default,112,0,0,0,,恐惧让我们活下来，小伊，永远要懂得害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:41.03,*Default,113,0,0,0,,这一切有什么意义？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:42.71,*Default,114,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:45.79,*Default,115,0,0,0,,我们为什么在这儿？我们这么做是为了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.07,*Default,116,0,0,0,,没人说过求生是好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.43,*Default,117,0,0,0,,没有什么是好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:54.43,*Default,118,0,0,0,,-你能不能下来，小伊？  -古勒格？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:55.58,*Default,119,0,0,0,,-小伊  -古勒格
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:56.66,*Default,120,0,0,0,,-好  -下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:58.35,*Default,121,0,0,0,,-好，我试过了  -走开！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.67,*Default,122,0,0,0,,我只是不懂她为什么需要独自呆着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.71,*Default,123,0,0,0,,-只是想问问  -她在想事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:03.94,*Default,124,0,0,0,,需要自己的空间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:06.95,*Default,125,0,0,0,,什么事？要多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.79,*Default,126,0,0,0,,真的吗？她都不听我说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.47,*Default,127,0,0,0,,看，她听着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.19,*Default,128,0,0,0,,要想幸存她就得遵守规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.63,*Default,129,0,0,0,,讲故事怎么样？小伊喜欢听故事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.99,*Default,130,0,0,0,,好主意，想听故事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.83,*Default,131,0,0,0,,好耶，快讲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.99,*Default,132,0,0,0,,好，借用一下，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.03,*Default,133,0,0,0,,小伊！你以前的最爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.31,*Default,134,0,0,0,,我都好几年不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:33.15,*Default,135,0,0,0,,今晚我们讲干脆熊的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:37.35,*Default,136,0,0,0,,很久很久以前，这只小熊还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:40.35,*Default,137,0,0,0,,她活着因为她听爸爸的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:43.75,*Default,138,0,0,0,,在黑暗与恐惧中一成不变地生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:45.97,*Default,139,0,0,0,,所以她很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:50.51,*Default,140,0,0,0,,但干脆熊有个致命的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:54.67,*Default,141,0,0,0,,她心中充满了…好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.55,*Default,142,0,0,0,,-古勒格！  -好，好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:59.87,*Default,143,0,0,0,,有一天，当她在树上的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:03.79,*Default,144,0,0,0,,这好奇的小熊想爬到树顶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:06.19,*Default,145,0,0,0,,她刚爬到树顶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:10.19,*Default,146,0,0,0,,就看见新奇的东西，然后就死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:12.19,*Default,147,0,0,0,,-就那样死了？  -对！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:16.55,*Default,148,0,0,0,,她临死前的恐惧还凝结在脸上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:18.19,*Default,149,0,0,0,,每天都一样的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.86,*Default,150,0,0,0,,懂了，爸爸，我绝不会尝试新事物的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:22.31,*Default,151,0,0,0,,好孩子，桑克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:25.55,*Default,152,0,0,0,,好了，大家磨磨牙，叠一块儿睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.14,*Default,153,0,0,0,,憋死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.79,*Default,154,0,0,0,,你会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.83,*Default,155,0,0,0,,我也是人，像你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.51,*Default,156,0,0,0,,和你…差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:13.58,*Default,157,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:14.82,*Default,158,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.35,*Default,159,0,0,0,,你能不能…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.19,*Default,160,0,0,0,,好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:21.95,*Default,161,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:25.90,*Default,162,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:28.19,*Default,163,0,0,0,,我是偷偷跑出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:41.98,*Default,164,0,0,0,,小伊不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:43.19,*Default,165,0,0,0,,什么？古勒格！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:44.47,*Default,166,0,0,0,,呆在洞里别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.83,*Default,167,0,0,0,,你真强壮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.47,*Default,168,0,0,0,,不！那是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.35,*Default,169,0,0,0,,-求你了！  -不！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.23,*Default,170,0,0,0,,-快不行了，我能搞定  -不！我发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.75,*Default,171,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:09.19,*Default,172,0,0,0,,我讨厌黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.95,*Default,173,0,0,0,,来吧，来吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.55,*Default,174,0,0,0,,它这么听话？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:28.02,*Default,175,0,0,0,,嗯，算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:29.18,*Default,176,0,0,0,,是太阳？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:32.10,*Default,177,0,0,0,,不，不，是火
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:35.63,*Default,178,0,0,0,,你好啊，火
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.47,*Default,179,0,0,0,,它没有生命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:42.51,*Default,180,0,0,0,,但你说它要不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:44.58,*Default,181,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:46.99,*Default,182,0,0,0,,你们来自同一个地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:49.23,*Default,183,0,0,0,,不，我创造了它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:51.03,*Default,184,0,0,0,,-那给我也弄点  -好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:52.07,*Default,185,0,0,0,,快点弄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:53.22,*Default,186,0,0,0,,它不在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.19,*Default,187,0,0,0,,快，快弄点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:59.45,*Default,188,0,0,0,,你经常这么做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.04,0:20:02.87,*Default,189,0,0,0,,你死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.11,*Default,190,0,0,0,,你要是死了我能拿你的火吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.51,*Default,191,0,0,0,,好凉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:15.19,*Default,192,0,0,0,,你说呢？贝壳听筒，启动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.18,*Default,193,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:19.59,*Default,194,0,0,0,,虎妞，我们得快点闪了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:22.03,*Default,195,0,0,0,,我还不认识你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.66,*Default,196,0,0,0,,我叫盖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:25.82,*Default,197,0,0,0,,盖？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.59,*Default,198,0,0,0,,这是皮带猴，会做饭，会聊天，会导航
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:30.91,*Default,199,0,0,0,,还能用来系裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:32.99,*Default,200,0,0,0,,什么是“系裤子”？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:34.47,*Default,201,0,0,0,,你叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.10,*Default,202,0,0,0,,小伊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.35,*Default,203,0,0,0,,告诉你，小伊，世界要毁灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:39.50,*Default,204,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:41.83,*Default,205,0,0,0,,我称之为“世界末日”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:46.34,*Default,206,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:47.95,*Default,207,0,0,0,,我看见了，正往这边来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.59,*Default,208,0,0,0,,首先，大地会摇晃开裂，然后所有东西都掉进去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:52.90,*Default,209,0,0,0,,火，岩浆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.30,*Default,210,0,0,0,,我不想太夸张，但…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:00.66,*Default,211,0,0,0,,相信我，现在我们脚下的一切都将不复存在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:02.95,*Default,212,0,0,0,,我们得去高地，我知道有座山，在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:04.79,*Default,213,0,0,0,,这是我们唯一的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:06.71,*Default,214,0,0,0,,和我一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:11.26,*Default,215,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:12.75,*Default,216,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:15.94,*Default,217,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:22.99,*Default,218,0,0,0,,如果你活下来了，呼我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:29.71,*Default,219,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:31.83,*Default,220,0,0,0,,人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:33.62,*Default,221,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:36.78,*Default,222,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.51,*Default,223,0,0,0,,你没事吧？什么把你抓来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:41.03,*Default,224,0,0,0,,什么都不是，我自己上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:43.47,*Default,225,0,0,0,,你什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:45.75,*Default,226,0,0,0,,爸爸，听我解释
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.71,*Default,227,0,0,0,,你从来不让我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.71,*Default,228,0,0,0,,我要关你禁闭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:01.42,*Default,229,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:04.47,*Default,230,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:05.78,*Default,231,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:07.38,*Default,232,0,0,0,,古勒格！怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:10.83,*Default,233,0,0,0,,气死我了，我不想和她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:12.15,*Default,234,0,0,0,,小伊？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:15.31,*Default,235,0,0,0,,你不会相信的，我发现了新事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:16.38,*Default,236,0,0,0,,新事物？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:17.66,*Default,237,0,0,0,,新事物会造成大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:18.82,*Default,238,0,0,0,,等等，等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.71,*Default,239,0,0,0,,小伊，给我呆在绝杀圈里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:22.79,*Default,240,0,0,0,,-但它并没有不好啊  -新东西总是不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.35,*Default,241,0,0,0,,不，他人很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:26.47,*Default,242,0,0,0,,什么？“他”？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:30.63,*Default,243,0,0,0,,我一开始以为他是头野猪，但接着他变成了个男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.78,*Default,244,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:33.83,*Default,245,0,0,0,,通常是相反的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:36.34,*Default,246,0,0,0,,小伊找了个猪男友！小伊找了个猪男友！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:37.99,*Default,247,0,0,0,,是真的，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:40.03,*Default,248,0,0,0,,我这就叫他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:59.07,*Default,249,0,0,0,,你们都怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:00.22,*Default,250,0,0,0,,这很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:02.27,*Default,251,0,0,0,,这很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:04.55,*Default,252,0,0,0,,知道什么是危险吗？看着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:07.10,*Default,253,0,0,0,,我的鼻子！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:08.35,*Default,254,0,0,0,,小伊，够了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:09.83,*Default,255,0,0,0,,我们回洞里去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.51,*Default,256,0,0,0,,你给我一直呆着直到…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:15.06,*Default,257,0,0,0,,你比她还大！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:16.22,*Default,258,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:19.71,*Default,259,0,0,0,,你休想一直把我关在洞里！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.20,0:23:32.79,*Default,260,0,0,0,,他说过会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:40.39,*Default,261,0,0,0,,快回洞里去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.20,0:23:43.26,*Default,262,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.04,0:24:15.35,*Default,263,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:17.66,*Default,264,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:24:58.47,*Default,265,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:24:59.87,*Default,266,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.40,0:25:03.55,*Default,267,0,0,0,,古勒格，山洞…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.72,0:25:05.35,*Default,268,0,0,0,,没了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.60,0:25:08.82,*Default,269,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:47.95,*Default,270,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.48,0:26:05.46,*Default,271,0,0,0,,我们得去那儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.50,0:26:08.48,*Default,272,0,0,0,,不，不，哪儿都不许去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.60,0:26:13.67,*Default,273,0,0,0,,那小子还说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.52,0:26:39.50,*Default,274,0,0,0,,古勒格？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.24,0:26:41.67,*Default,275,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:42.87,*Default,276,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:06.35,*Default,277,0,0,0,,一，二，三，四，五…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:11.03,*Default,278,0,0,0,,六
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.79,*Default,279,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:16.11,*Default,280,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.32,0:27:18.03,*Default,281,0,0,0,,在下面
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.24,0:27:20.47,*Default,282,0,0,0,,一个更低的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.64,0:27:23.91,*Default,283,0,0,0,,不过可以确定我们无法原路返回了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.36,0:27:27.59,*Default,284,0,0,0,,小沙？是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.16,0:27:31.39,*Default,285,0,0,0,,不，不，等等，回来，小沙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:41.39,*Default,286,0,0,0,,我们不能这么在外面呆着
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:44.91,*Default,287,0,0,0,,我们需要找个山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:47.83,*Default,288,0,0,0,,踩着我的脚印走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.52,0:27:50.15,*Default,289,0,0,0,,好了，不要出声
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:52.78,*Default,290,0,0,0,,希望不要被大动物察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.64,0:28:03.75,*Default,291,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:06.27,*Default,292,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.44,0:28:07.47,*Default,293,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.24,0:28:09.59,*Default,294,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.76,0:28:10.82,*Default,295,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:17.06,*Default,296,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.80,0:28:20.94,*Default,297,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.12,0:28:22.18,*Default,298,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.34,*Default,299,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:38.59,*Default,300,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.96,0:28:42.50,*Default,301,0,0,0,,只想确定一下，我们要找一模一样的山洞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.68,0:28:45.14,*Default,302,0,0,0,,如果是我…我是说如果
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:47.70,*Default,303,0,0,0,,让我选山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.44,0:28:53.03,*Default,304,0,0,0,,我会选个小点儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:55.54,*Default,305,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:00.42,*Default,306,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:02.43,*Default,307,0,0,0,,我来搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.20,0:29:13.67,*Default,308,0,0,0,,来吧，爸爸，揍它们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.24,0:29:15.59,*Default,309,0,0,0,,你把它们…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:16.87,*Default,310,0,0,0,,它们真…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:18.39,*Default,311,0,0,0,,太爽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:20.34,*Default,312,0,0,0,,爸爸，我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.52,0:29:22.03,*Default,313,0,0,0,,别老往它们拳头上撞！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:26.16,*Default,314,0,0,0,,古勒格，你爽够了我们就上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.56,0:29:34.51,*Default,315,0,0,0,,对了！知道敌不过这个吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.63,*Default,316,0,0,0,,爬！爬！快爬！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:06.67,*Default,317,0,0,0,,有山洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:07.95,*Default,318,0,0,0,,快！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.36,0:30:10.71,*Default,319,0,0,0,,快走，快点！走！赶紧！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.04,0:30:15.99,*Default,320,0,0,0,,快看！这山洞有舌头耶！太酷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:33.87,*Default,321,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.04,0:30:38.11,*Default,322,0,0,0,,一，二，三，四，五，六…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:39.99,*Default,323,0,0,0,,七
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.16,0:30:43.47,*Default,324,0,0,0,,如果算上这只死肥猫的话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:30:56.03,*Default,325,0,0,0,,它怕黑！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.00,0:30:59.63,*Default,326,0,0,0,,等等，我们也怕黑！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.56,0:31:37.87,*Default,327,0,0,0,,绝杀阵型！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:50.45,*Default,328,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.96,0:32:10.94,*Default,329,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:12.47,*Default,330,0,0,0,,-是洞人！  -洞人？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.64,0:33:15.15,*Default,331,0,0,0,,就是穴居人！退后！他们和野兽没什么分别
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.32,0:33:17.91,*Default,332,0,0,0,,-看见他们多骨，倾斜的前额了？  -嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:20.59,*Default,333,0,0,0,,原始的大獠牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.04,0:33:22.02,*Default,334,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:23.75,*Default,335,0,0,0,,过多的体毛？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.16,0:33:25.35,*Default,336,0,0,0,,这个还有尾巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.48,0:33:26.46,*Default,337,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.56,0:33:29.23,*Default,338,0,0,0,,好了，闭上眼睛，我要杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.44,0:33:32.27,*Default,339,0,0,0,,不，不行，他们是我家人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.44,0:33:33.42,*Default,340,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:36.35,*Default,341,0,0,0,,太阳在他手中！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.52,0:33:38.90,*Default,342,0,0,0,,不，不，是火！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.12,0:33:40.39,*Default,343,0,0,0,,哪儿来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.56,0:33:41.91,*Default,344,0,0,0,,他造的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.12,0:33:43.10,*Default,345,0,0,0,,给我整点！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.28,0:33:44.55,*Default,346,0,0,0,,他身上不产这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.72,0:33:46.19,*Default,347,0,0,0,,整啊！整点儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.68,0:33:50.11,*Default,348,0,0,0,,你可真像你女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.28,0:33:51.79,*Default,349,0,0,0,,好了，现在他被你整坏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.96,0:33:53.67,*Default,350,0,0,0,,是小太阳！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.20,0:33:56.79,*Default,351,0,0,0,,退后！我们不知道它想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:33:59.79,*Default,352,0,0,0,,现在我们坐在这儿等太阳回来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.96,0:34:02.34,*Default,353,0,0,0,,明天我们找个新山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.56,0:34:05.19,*Default,354,0,0,0,,假装今天什么都没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.36,0:34:06.63,*Default,355,0,0,0,,这有意思吧，小伊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.80,0:34:08.07,*Default,356,0,0,0,,小伊，别碰他！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.24,0:34:09.55,*Default,357,0,0,0,,谁知道他去过哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.72,0:34:11.63,*Default,358,0,0,0,,爸爸，小沙在弄火！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.32,0:34:14.62,*Default,359,0,0,0,,小沙！不！火不是用来玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:16.79,*Default,360,0,0,0,,多可爱的小伙子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.96,0:34:18.75,*Default,361,0,0,0,,退后！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.84,0:34:22.75,*Default,362,0,0,0,,不，不，不，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.76,0:34:26.95,*Default,363,0,0,0,,它喜欢我！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.12,0:34:28.47,*Default,364,0,0,0,,它在咬我！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.52,0:34:34.03,*Default,365,0,0,0,,桑克！快去干草丛里躲躲！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.60,0:34:39.80,*Default,366,0,0,0,,别这样，求你了！我才九岁！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.84,0:34:40.82,*Default,367,0,0,0,,它还在咬我！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.44,0:34:45.83,*Default,368,0,0,0,,火宝宝！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.20,0:34:50.31,*Default,369,0,0,0,,你爸爸刚才想杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:52.27,*Default,370,0,0,0,,对，但我不会让他得逞的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.48,0:34:55.99,*Default,371,0,0,0,,挺住，儿子，回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.56,0:34:58.99,*Default,372,0,0,0,,它停不了，别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.32,0:35:02.35,*Default,373,0,0,0,,滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.52,0:35:04.39,*Default,374,0,0,0,,尽情地吃吧，宝宝们！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.24,0:35:07.07,*Default,375,0,0,0,,别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:09.18,*Default,376,0,0,0,,要死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:13.23,*Default,377,0,0,0,,我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:22.48,*Default,378,0,0,0,,一旦了解了他们就不觉得可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.20,0:35:26.19,*Default,379,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.36,0:35:27.75,*Default,380,0,0,0,,忘介绍了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.92,0:35:30.15,*Default,381,0,0,0,,我们是克鲁家族！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.44,0:35:31.66,*Default,382,0,0,0,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.44,0:35:33.42,*Default,383,0,0,0,,我叫盖
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.52,0:35:34.87,*Default,384,0,0,0,,嗨， 盖
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.44,0:35:49.47,*Default,385,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:51.67,*Default,386,0,0,0,,看起来像变戏法！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.84,0:35:54.07,*Default,387,0,0,0,,闻起来很好吃耶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.88,0:36:02.87,*Default,388,0,0,0,,别吃，是新事物
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:08.27,*Default,389,0,0,0,,还活着！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.44,0:36:10.35,*Default,390,0,0,0,,来吧，继续吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.96,0:36:15.63,*Default,391,0,0,0,,盖呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:23.26,*Default,392,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.44,0:36:24.42,*Default,393,0,0,0,,要去哪儿啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.60,0:36:27.11,*Default,394,0,0,0,,上山，上高地，世界末日，记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.28,0:36:30.27,*Default,395,0,0,0,,早发生了，毁了我们的山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.44,0:36:32.79,*Default,396,0,0,0,,不，那只是末日的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:35.43,*Default,397,0,0,0,,结尾还没来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.71,*Default,398,0,0,0,,小伊，放下他
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.84,0:36:42.43,*Default,399,0,0,0,,我们不能让他走！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.60,0:36:45.79,*Default,400,0,0,0,,万一日落前我们没找到山洞怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.96,0:36:47.67,*Default,401,0,0,0,,万一要找好几天怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.40,0:36:50.75,*Default,402,0,0,0,,万一那些鸟回来了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.32,0:36:55.31,*Default,403,0,0,0,,我们需要他的火，呆瓜！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.32,0:36:59.47,*Default,404,0,0,0,,好吧，在找到山洞前你和我们呆在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.64,0:37:02.67,*Default,405,0,0,0,,什么？不，不行！放了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.12,0:37:04.71,*Default,406,0,0,0,,你们愿意就留下，放了我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:05.99,*Default,407,0,0,0,,我有理想
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.20,0:37:08.23,*Default,408,0,0,0,,有使命，有活着的理由！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.40,0:37:09.51,*Default,409,0,0,0,,现在没了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:11.50,*Default,410,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:13.50,*Default,411,0,0,0,,我们去那座山吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.64,0:37:14.62,*Default,412,0,0,0,,太远
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:17.63,*Default,413,0,0,0,,爸爸只想着山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.84,0:37:21.22,*Default,414,0,0,0,,那山上有山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:22.62,*Default,415,0,0,0,,你去过？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.84,0:37:23.87,*Default,416,0,0,0,,山嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.04,0:37:26.34,*Default,417,0,0,0,,很安全，有山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.52,0:37:28.51,*Default,418,0,0,0,,水，手杖
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.72,0:37:31.23,*Default,419,0,0,0,,妈妈，你听见了吗？我能有自己的手杖了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:33.83,*Default,420,0,0,0,,没错，手杖，还有山洞，山洞，手杖
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.00,0:37:35.14,*Default,421,0,0,0,,神奇的手杖，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.00,0:37:37.14,*Default,422,0,0,0,,别出声！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.72,0:37:49.11,*Default,423,0,0,0,,那东西好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.20,0:37:53.07,*Default,424,0,0,0,,别，别，别，没事，小沙
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:54.59,*Default,425,0,0,0,,那只是皮带猴
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:37:59.91,*Default,426,0,0,0,,我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.08,0:38:02.54,*Default,427,0,0,0,,我们去那座山！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.16,0:38:05.23,*Default,428,0,0,0,,别问我为什么，只是直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.40,0:38:07.07,*Default,429,0,0,0,,感觉那是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:10.35,*Default,430,0,0,0,,我不清楚，古勒格，我们从未走过那么远的路
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.52,0:38:12.55,*Default,431,0,0,0,,我怕我的脚受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.72,0:38:15.35,*Default,432,0,0,0,,我怕我没法活着走到那
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.36,0:38:17.71,*Default,433,0,0,0,,那就上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:20.59,*Default,434,0,0,0,,来吧，想想
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.76,0:38:24.75,*Default,435,0,0,0,,一家人其乐融融地享受一段漫长缓慢的旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.92,0:38:26.83,*Default,436,0,0,0,,朝夕相处，亲密无间
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.00,0:38:28.71,*Default,437,0,0,0,,充满了故事和欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.24,0:38:33.27,*Default,438,0,0,0,,我们会更爱彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:36.42,*Default,439,0,0,0,,让她下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:38.67,*Default,440,0,0,0,,如果你没准备好和她打，就不要看她的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:42.67,*Default,441,0,0,0,,你能看好自己的大胳膊吗？别老撞我！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:45.67,*Default,442,0,0,0,,这有趣吧？我们第一次一起旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.40,0:38:48.07,*Default,443,0,0,0,,别推我，否则揪掉你舌头！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.95,0:38:51.27,*Default,444,0,0,0,,你想让我们掉头回去？想吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.28,0:38:53.72,*Default,445,0,0,0,,我立即就可以让大家打道回府！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.80,0:38:55.03,*Default,446,0,0,0,,爸爸，我要嘘嘘！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.20,0:38:57.27,*Default,447,0,0,0,,-得了，你能憋住的  -憋不住
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.48,0:38:58.62,*Default,448,0,0,0,,小沙，把它吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:38:59.91,*Default,449,0,0,0,,我在摸…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.08,0:39:02.54,*Default,450,0,0,0,,爸爸，我还是想尿！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.72,0:39:05.55,*Default,451,0,0,0,,好吧，别闹了，那你快点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.83,0:39:08.83,*Default,452,0,0,0,,-有东西咬我  -活该！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.83,0:39:10.60,*Default,453,0,0,0,,爸爸，我能扛他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.60,0:39:11.58,*Default,454,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.68,0:39:13.19,*Default,455,0,0,0,,-现在呢？  -不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.32,0:39:14.59,*Default,456,0,0,0,,-现在呢？  -不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.68,0:39:15.66,*Default,457,0,0,0,,现在呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.76,0:39:17.99,*Default,458,0,0,0,,我可以扛一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:21.43,*Default,459,0,0,0,,不行，还是不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:23.75,*Default,460,0,0,0,,我可不想当饿死鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.72,0:39:26.52,*Default,461,0,0,0,,古勒格，我们都要累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.60,0:39:27.79,*Default,462,0,0,0,,等到那就吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:29.39,*Default,463,0,0,0,,等不及了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.56,0:39:31.27,*Default,464,0,0,0,,我先吃点点心
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:33.87,*Default,465,0,0,0,,别！他会刺你的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:35.95,*Default,466,0,0,0,,他不是食物，是宠物，我的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.12,0:39:37.18,*Default,467,0,0,0,,什么是宠物？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.36,0:39:39.11,*Default,468,0,0,0,,你不能吃的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.28,0:39:41.27,*Default,469,0,0,0,,我们只是不吃小孩儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:46.11,*Default,470,0,0,0,,养什么宠物，让人搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:48.79,*Default,471,0,0,0,,-那是…食物！  -不，求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.96,0:39:50.71,*Default,472,0,0,0,,不是他，是那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.32,0:39:53.79,*Default,473,0,0,0,,有食物就能解决一切
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.96,0:39:55.47,*Default,474,0,0,0,,进入狩猎状态
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.96,0:39:59.47,*Default,475,0,0,0,,不是你！你还在关禁闭
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.64,0:40:00.95,*Default,476,0,0,0,,来吧，桑克
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.12,0:40:02.75,*Default,477,0,0,0,,我脚疼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.16,0:40:10.83,*Default,478,0,0,0,,-你挺紧张啊  -我不紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.40,0:40:14.47,*Default,479,0,0,0,,气呼呼的女孩想参与狩猎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.28,0:40:16.47,*Default,480,0,0,0,,我还没准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.76,0:40:19.51,*Default,481,0,0,0,,坚持住，桑克，我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.80,0:40:21.51,*Default,482,0,0,0,,为什么老追我？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.80,0:40:23.99,*Default,483,0,0,0,,他们在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.16,0:40:25.35,*Default,484,0,0,0,,狩猎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.52,0:40:27.51,*Default,485,0,0,0,,离我远点！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:28.82,*Default,486,0,0,0,,别蒙我了，他们到底在干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.00,0:40:31.99,*Default,487,0,0,0,,你那么多蛋呢，再下一个不就得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.04,0:40:49.03,*Default,488,0,0,0,,你还觉得我不够惨是不？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:53.47,*Default,489,0,0,0,,来吧，谁想吃蝎子？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.64,0:40:58.10,*Default,490,0,0,0,,鸟和蛋呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:40:59.86,*Default,491,0,0,0,,没逮到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.04,0:41:02.67,*Default,492,0,0,0,,但是当鸟落在我身上把我轧进地里时
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:04.91,*Default,493,0,0,0,,这蝎子过来占便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.79,0:41:07.43,*Default,494,0,0,0,,一事生一事，结果它反倒成了我们的盘中餐
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.56,0:41:08.59,*Default,495,0,0,0,,双赢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:11.39,*Default,496,0,0,0,,不够吃，不够吃，我还要！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.56,0:41:14.35,*Default,497,0,0,0,,我还要！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.47,0:41:17.27,*Default,498,0,0,0,,快看，她不会吃我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.56,0:41:18.54,*Default,499,0,0,0,,你太瘦了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.72,0:41:20.75,*Default,500,0,0,0,,如果她想吃人，她会选…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.52,0:41:22.55,*Default,501,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.64,0:41:24.23,*Default,502,0,0,0,,她不松嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.40,0:41:26.19,*Default,503,0,0,0,,用手杖
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.04,0:41:29.23,*Default,504,0,0,0,,滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.56,0:41:31.19,*Default,505,0,0,0,,你这个变态的老禽兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.36,0:41:33.15,*Default,506,0,0,0,,快！用手杖撬开她的嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.72,0:41:36.31,*Default,507,0,0,0,,稳住她，用石头砸
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.16,0:41:40.35,*Default,508,0,0,0,,快砸她的腿啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.48,0:41:42.75,*Default,509,0,0,0,,为什么滚走哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.92,0:41:44.91,*Default,510,0,0,0,,我就想找点吃的去！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:48.23,*Default,511,0,0,0,,你就吃虫子吧，管够！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.44,0:41:49.42,*Default,512,0,0,0,,求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.40,0:41:51.83,*Default,513,0,0,0,,我让你帮我狩猎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.00,0:41:53.06,*Default,514,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.88,0:41:56.34,*Default,515,0,0,0,,别管我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:58.03,*Default,516,0,0,0,,把我的传说流传下去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.84,0:42:06.19,*Default,517,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.28,0:42:08.34,*Default,518,0,0,0,,你管这个叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.52,0:42:09.71,*Default,519,0,0,0,,陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:11.03,*Default,520,0,0,0,,会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.20,0:42:12.18,*Default,521,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:23.11,*Default,522,0,0,0,,你这么寂寞有多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.04,0:42:29.55,*Default,523,0,0,0,,接下来我们干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.80,0:42:32.43,*Default,524,0,0,0,,你的演技怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.12,0:42:59.31,*Default,525,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.64,0:43:05.11,*Default,526,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.42,*Default,527,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.64,0:43:08.31,*Default,528,0,0,0,,-那是你的  -抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.68,0:43:10.99,*Default,529,0,0,0,,另一只手
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.16,0:43:13.54,*Default,530,0,0,0,,-那是我的手！  -好，我拿开…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.36,0:43:27.63,*Default,531,0,0,0,,它没踩到你的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.80,0:43:30.23,*Default,532,0,0,0,,对，我发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.52,0:43:35.63,*Default,533,0,0,0,,小伊呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.24,0:43:43.79,*Default,534,0,0,0,,太牛了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.12,0:43:46.18,*Default,535,0,0,0,,小伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.92,0:43:47.95,*Default,536,0,0,0,,爸爸，不！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.64,0:44:01.59,*Default,537,0,0,0,,味道真是棒极了！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.52,0:44:31.51,*Default,538,0,0,0,,看来没有剩菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.68,0:44:33.59,*Default,539,0,0,0,,剩菜是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:35.91,*Default,540,0,0,0,,当食物过多的时候会剩下些的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.44,0:44:38.59,*Default,541,0,0,0,,我们从来都没那么多食物的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:53.19,*Default,542,0,0,0,,古勒格，讲个故事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.36,0:44:55.71,*Default,543,0,0,0,,好主意，讲个故事怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.24,0:44:58.15,*Default,544,0,0,0,,耶，好耶！快讲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.84,0:45:04.35,*Default,545,0,0,0,,从前有个小老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.52,0:45:07.08,*Default,546,0,0,0,,和家人住在山洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:08.43,*Default,547,0,0,0,,规矩有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.00,0:45:12.84,*Default,548,0,0,0,,但最简单最重要的一条是，绝不要在晚上离开山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.72,0:45:18.51,*Default,549,0,0,0,,洞门很重，应该很容易记住的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.68,0:45:19.95,*Default,550,0,0,0,,是啊，多容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.12,0:45:21.34,*Default,551,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.16,0:45:24.43,*Default,552,0,0,0,,但当大家都睡着的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.60,0:45:25.95,*Default,553,0,0,0,,她还是跑了出去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:27.59,*Default,554,0,0,0,,-不！  -没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.76,0:45:30.51,*Default,555,0,0,0,,结果山洞马上就毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.68,0:45:33.27,*Default,556,0,0,0,,大家不得不踏上一个漫长无聊的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.44,0:45:35.19,*Default,557,0,0,0,,还遇到了一个怪小子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.36,0:45:36.79,*Default,558,0,0,0,,最后全死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.84,0:45:40.03,*Default,559,0,0,0,,讲完了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.36,0:45:44.71,*Default,560,0,0,0,,这个揪心的结局好突然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.88,0:45:46.47,*Default,561,0,0,0,,我的故事可不会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.68,0:45:48.47,*Default,562,0,0,0,,太棒了！今晚可以听两个故事！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.64,0:46:01.23,*Default,563,0,0,0,,好吧，但我没古勒格讲得好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:09.19,*Default,564,0,0,0,,从前，有一只美丽的小老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.36,0:46:12.27,*Default,565,0,0,0,,她和家人住在山洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.44,0:46:16.19,*Default,566,0,0,0,,她的父母告诉她去哪儿都行
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.36,0:46:19.90,*Default,567,0,0,0,,但千万别去悬崖，你会掉下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.08,0:46:22.64,*Default,568,0,0,0,,然后就死了，不错的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.28,0:46:25.27,*Default,569,0,0,0,,但当没人的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.48,0:46:29.78,*Default,570,0,0,0,,她就会去悬崖
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.96,0:46:31.87,*Default,571,0,0,0,,因为她越靠近悬崖边
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.04,0:46:35.47,*Default,572,0,0,0,,她就会听到越多，看到越多
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.64,0:46:37.55,*Default,573,0,0,0,,感受到越多的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.76,0:46:40.95,*Default,574,0,0,0,,最后
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.12,0:46:44.31,*Default,575,0,0,0,,她站在了悬崖边上
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.48,0:46:46.23,*Default,576,0,0,0,,她看见了亮光
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.40,0:46:49.47,*Default,577,0,0,0,,她伸手去摸
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.04,0:46:51.18,*Default,578,0,0,0,,她滑倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.52,0:46:52.87,*Default,579,0,0,0,,她掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.08,0:46:54.95,*Default,580,0,0,0,,她飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.28,0:46:58.67,*Default,581,0,0,0,,她飞向哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:00.26,*Default,582,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:01.55,*Default,583,0,0,0,,明天？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.72,0:47:04.59,*Default,584,0,0,0,,一个天空中挂满了太阳的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.80,0:47:06.15,*Default,585,0,0,0,,那得老亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.32,0:47:09.07,*Default,586,0,0,0,,一个与今天和昨天都不同的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.24,0:47:12.03,*Default,587,0,0,0,,一个更加美好的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.88,0:47:15.67,*Default,588,0,0,0,,明天不是个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.72,0:47:18.03,*Default,589,0,0,0,,你看不见的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.20,0:47:20.07,*Default,590,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.76,0:47:22.15,*Default,591,0,0,0,,我见过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.00,0:47:26.87,*Default,592,0,0,0,,那就是我要去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.79,0:47:39.77,*Default,593,0,0,0,,好了，我们该闭眼睛睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.68,0:47:41.82,*Default,594,0,0,0,,睡醒后
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.04,0:47:44.23,*Default,595,0,0,0,,我们就去寻找那片传说中的乐土
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.40,0:47:45.43,*Default,596,0,0,0,,是明天？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.52,0:47:46.83,*Default,597,0,0,0,,是山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.92,0:48:27.71,*Default,598,0,0,0,,太险了，差点就玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.92,0:48:29.67,*Default,599,0,0,0,,我看着呢，没事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.88,0:48:30.99,*Default,600,0,0,0,,我们得走快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.16,0:48:34.19,*Default,601,0,0,0,,你们除了闲逛模式还有别的速度吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.36,0:48:36.39,*Default,602,0,0,0,,要是我这时就会快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.60,0:48:38.39,*Default,603,0,0,0,,嘿，你有空吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.60,0:48:40.39,*Default,604,0,0,0,,老虎怎么飞起来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.60,0:48:42.98,*Default,605,0,0,0,,在树桩里我不想讲
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.16,0:48:44.51,*Default,606,0,0,0,,出来讲才好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.68,0:48:47.67,*Default,607,0,0,0,,这交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.60,0:48:49.87,*Default,608,0,0,0,,桑克
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.04,0:48:51.99,*Default,609,0,0,0,,你脸上有蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:57.11,*Default,610,0,0,0,,他跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.92,0:49:05.43,*Default,611,0,0,0,,别踩这些奇怪的尖石头！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.60,0:49:06.87,*Default,612,0,0,0,,你是说这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.04,0:49:09.87,*Default,613,0,0,0,,怎么能不踩这些石头？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.04,0:49:11.75,*Default,614,0,0,0,,站到边上去，丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.08,0:49:17.03,*Default,615,0,0,0,,嘿，没人在听！没人在听！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.20,0:49:20.03,*Default,616,0,0,0,,你们不能踩！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.92,0:49:34.06,*Default,617,0,0,0,,回来！回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.72,0:49:37.39,*Default,618,0,0,0,,我们逃生的希望跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.56,0:49:39.39,*Default,619,0,0,0,,还有我们的树桩！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.40,0:49:41.38,*Default,620,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.60,0:50:04.59,*Default,621,0,0,0,,跳起来也没用，起来时不疼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.76,0:50:06.07,*Default,622,0,0,0,,落下来就疼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.56,0:50:12.07,*Default,623,0,0,0,,不要用手，也不起作用！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.64,0:50:21.11,*Default,624,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.12,0:50:24.43,*Default,625,0,0,0,,我可以帮你们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:27.11,*Default,626,0,0,0,,但规矩得改改
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.28,0:50:29.27,*Default,627,0,0,0,,树桩之旅结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.44,0:50:30.75,*Default,628,0,0,0,,扔掉树桩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.16,0:50:37.11,*Default,629,0,0,0,,踢一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.28,0:50:41.75,*Default,630,0,0,0,,远点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.48,0:50:47.62,*Default,631,0,0,0,,真远哪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.32,0:50:51.51,*Default,632,0,0,0,,好了，聪明的盖
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.68,0:50:52.95,*Default,633,0,0,0,,现在呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.64,0:51:09.67,*Default,634,0,0,0,,好鱼鱼，好鱼鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.20,0:51:15.83,*Default,635,0,0,0,,好了，你可以睁开眼睛了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.12,0:51:22.63,*Default,636,0,0,0,,好喜欢！但我的脚呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.80,0:51:23.99,*Default,637,0,0,0,,还在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:26.10,*Default,638,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.48,0:51:29.70,*Default,639,0,0,0,,你真沉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.88,0:51:30.99,*Default,640,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.16,0:51:32.30,*Default,641,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.36,0:51:34.99,*Default,642,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.36,0:51:39.63,*Default,643,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:41.51,*Default,644,0,0,0,,她起来了，没事了，我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.68,0:51:45.30,*Default,645,0,0,0,,这些鞋太棒了！你怎么想到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.32,0:51:51.39,*Default,646,0,0,0,,我管它叫脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.56,0:51:53.86,*Default,647,0,0,0,,我确信主意就是从这里产生的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.04,0:51:57.07,*Default,648,0,0,0,,爸爸，我没有脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.36,0:52:00.51,*Default,649,0,0,0,,没脑子我们不也好好活到了现在
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.72,0:52:03.87,*Default,650,0,0,0,,洞穴人不需要脑子，我们有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:08.31,*Default,651,0,0,0,,我们要的是这个，弱者才需要想点子！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.52,0:52:10.71,*Default,652,0,0,0,,我们去那座山吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.88,0:52:16.03,*Default,653,0,0,0,,太好看了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.20,0:52:18.39,*Default,654,0,0,0,,好鱼鱼，别吃我的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.99,0:52:58.28,*Default,655,0,0,0,,老虎是怎么飞起来的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:53:00.03,*Default,656,0,0,0,,她跳上了太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.20,0:53:01.91,*Default,657,0,0,0,,骑着它飞到了明天
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.88,0:53:05.87,*Default,658,0,0,0,,不，不，不！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.52,0:53:39.50,*Default,659,0,0,0,,嗨，爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.84,0:53:42.47,*Default,660,0,0,0,,拜拜，爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.32,0:53:49.83,*Default,661,0,0,0,,你们应该见过下雨吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.00,0:53:52.27,*Default,662,0,0,0,,我们不经常外出
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.32,0:54:14.83,*Default,663,0,0,0,,小伊，看起来很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.80,0:54:18.03,*Default,664,0,0,0,,爸爸，你看什么都很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.20,0:54:19.18,*Default,665,0,0,0,,小心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.40,0:54:20.67,*Default,666,0,0,0,,是吗？那好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.88,0:54:57.71,*Default,667,0,0,0,,不，不，不，不行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.24,0:55:22.07,*Default,668,0,0,0,,那熊说：你的洞？我上星期就在这儿放骨头了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.28,0:55:23.39,*Default,669,0,0,0,,上星期
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.36,0:55:25.87,*Default,670,0,0,0,,真是个有意思的故事！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.04,0:55:28.11,*Default,671,0,0,0,,这不是故事，是笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.28,0:55:29.55,*Default,672,0,0,0,,什么是笑话？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.76,0:55:32.75,*Default,673,0,0,0,,就是编点东西使你发笑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:39.10,*Default,674,0,0,0,,-给你  -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.28,0:55:42.23,*Default,675,0,0,0,,给你一个，这个给你…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.96,0:55:43.94,*Default,676,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.12,0:55:45.95,*Default,677,0,0,0,,行了，够了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.44,0:55:49.43,*Default,678,0,0,0,,大家为什么需要这些贝壳？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.60,0:55:51.63,*Default,679,0,0,0,,如果有人碰上了麻烦，可以向别人求救
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:54.59,*Default,680,0,0,0,,等等，你说我们要分开？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.76,0:55:56.19,*Default,681,0,0,0,,这样我们可以一次试更多的路
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.19,0:55:57.90,*Default,682,0,0,0,,这是最快的方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.92,0:56:00.43,*Default,683,0,0,0,,克鲁家从不分开，你的方法不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.60,0:56:01.58,*Default,684,0,0,0,,他们没事儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.76,0:56:02.98,*Default,685,0,0,0,,我们能行的，爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.16,0:56:04.75,*Default,686,0,0,0,,不，不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.96,0:56:06.95,*Default,687,0,0,0,,我是负责你们安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.99,0:56:09.88,*Default,688,0,0,0,,我说了算，我们不会分开的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.12,0:56:12.23,*Default,689,0,0,0,,你俩得分开
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.96,0:56:14.27,*Default,690,0,0,0,,就这么定了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.96,0:56:35.59,*Default,691,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.76,0:56:37.71,*Default,692,0,0,0,,大家都好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.88,0:56:39.15,*Default,693,0,0,0,,我们都好，古勒格！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.32,0:56:41.39,*Default,694,0,0,0,,爸爸？我有点害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.56,0:56:44.12,*Default,695,0,0,0,,告诉我该怎么做，我该咋办啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.28,0:56:46.15,*Default,696,0,0,0,,留在原地别动！我去找你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.32,0:56:47.91,*Default,697,0,0,0,,不！那样太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.08,0:56:50.99,*Default,698,0,0,0,,大家都往前走，我们会出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.16,0:56:52.14,*Default,699,0,0,0,,爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.16,0:56:55.67,*Default,700,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.84,0:56:57.19,*Default,701,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.36,0:56:59.82,*Default,702,0,0,0,,记住，不要不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:01.87,*Default,703,0,0,0,,你能行的！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.04,0:57:04.19,*Default,704,0,0,0,,没事儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.36,0:57:06.51,*Default,705,0,0,0,,我要昏过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.20,0:57:10.11,*Default,706,0,0,0,,小沙！小沙！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.84,0:59:01.43,*Default,707,0,0,0,,再给我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.04,0:59:06.39,*Default,708,0,0,0,,你扔的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.04,0:59:41.55,*Default,709,0,0,0,,跟我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.48,0:59:46.15,*Default,710,0,0,0,,嘿，小子，接住！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.08,0:59:51.30,*Default,711,0,0,0,,外婆？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.88,0:59:54.86,*Default,712,0,0,0,,妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.04,0:59:56.51,*Default,713,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.04,0:59:59.43,*Default,714,0,0,0,,古勒格呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.36,1:00:09.03,*Default,715,0,0,0,,我去找他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.28,1:00:17.51,*Default,716,0,0,0,,好孩子，谁是好孩子？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.68,1:00:19.71,*Default,717,0,0,0,,你是，没错，就是你，看看你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.88,1:00:21.67,*Default,718,0,0,0,,你要名字吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.84,1:00:23.51,*Default,719,0,0,0,,我叫你道格拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.72,1:00:25.99,*Default,720,0,0,0,,你会演节目吗？滚一圈
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.16,1:00:28.03,*Default,721,0,0,0,,来吧，道格拉斯，滚一圈
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.68,1:00:35.65,*Default,722,0,0,0,,好样的，道格拉斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.72,1:00:40.35,*Default,723,0,0,0,,我爱上过一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.52,1:00:43.35,*Default,724,0,0,0,,他是猎人，我是采集食物的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.52,1:00:45.90,*Default,725,0,0,0,,当时闹得满城风雨呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.72,1:00:50.07,*Default,726,0,0,0,,我们彼此喂果子吃，一起跳舞
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.24,1:00:53.55,*Default,727,0,0,0,,后来我爸爸用石头砸死了他  把我卖给了你们的外公
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:00:59.95,*Default,728,0,0,0,,克鲁家的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.12,1:01:01.39,*Default,729,0,0,0,,都下来！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.56,1:01:04.35,*Default,730,0,0,0,,古勒格，他们挺好的，和盖在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.92,1:01:07.11,*Default,731,0,0,0,,和盖在一起，好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.64,1:01:08.70,*Default,732,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.88,1:01:12.75,*Default,733,0,0,0,,谢谢你告诉我那个盖的最新情况
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.20,1:01:14.87,*Default,734,0,0,0,,好了，我要上去了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.04,1:01:19.71,*Default,735,0,0,0,,等你不烦人了就上来和我们一起吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.92,1:01:29.47,*Default,736,0,0,0,,要叠睡吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.72,1:01:35.47,*Default,737,0,0,0,,要听故事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.12,1:01:39.43,*Default,738,0,0,0,,有人要吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.00,1:01:46.07,*Default,739,0,0,0,,托克说：知道，是我画的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.80,1:01:49.63,*Default,740,0,0,0,,没道理
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.40,1:01:54.47,*Default,741,0,0,0,,我知道你一路带着我们很不容易
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.64,1:01:57.51,*Default,742,0,0,0,,但这几天是他们过得最开心的日子了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.84,1:02:01.30,*Default,743,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.60,1:02:26.16,*Default,744,0,0,0,,给你们看样东西
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.64,1:03:08.87,*Default,745,0,0,0,,天上有数不清的太阳
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.68,1:03:13.71,*Default,746,0,0,0,,每颗穿过我们天空的太阳都在那里休息
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.88,1:03:15.31,*Default,747,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.31,1:03:17.51,*Default,748,0,0,0,,我们在那里会很安全
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.56,1:03:20.39,*Default,749,0,0,0,,我要和盖一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.72,1:03:23.23,*Default,750,0,0,0,,不，不要带走我女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.60,1:03:29.35,*Default,751,0,0,0,,和我们一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.72,1:03:31.23,*Default,752,0,0,0,,我不能丢下古勒格
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.97,1:03:34.20,*Default,753,0,0,0,,我不在乎，算我一个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.24,1:03:35.87,*Default,754,0,0,0,,真的吗？妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.08,1:03:38.27,*Default,755,0,0,0,,古勒格不知道怎么保护我们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.44,1:03:40.55,*Default,756,0,0,0,,其实他没有任何点子
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.72,1:03:43.71,*Default,757,0,0,0,,不，不对，有一次他…呃…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.92,1:03:47.19,*Default,758,0,0,0,,承认吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.36,1:03:50.39,*Default,759,0,0,0,,如果他真能想出什么点子
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.56,1:03:52.75,*Default,760,0,0,0,,我会震惊得心脏病发而死的！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.24,1:03:59.22,*Default,761,0,0,0,,古勒格？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.36,1:04:00.55,*Default,762,0,0,0,,-爸爸？  -爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.40,1:04:04.64,*Default,763,0,0,0,,这么大个人哪能消失了呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.88,1:04:08.02,*Default,764,0,0,0,,等等，问问那个丑女人是否见到了爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.80,1:04:10.11,*Default,765,0,0,0,,我没见到他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.04,1:04:12.63,*Default,766,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.88,1:04:17.58,*Default,767,0,0,0,,我昨晚彻夜未眠，简直是灵感如泉涌
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.76,1:04:19.39,*Default,768,0,0,0,,那是蛇吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.56,1:04:21.59,*Default,769,0,0,0,,是皮带！最新改良款！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.48,1:04:26.07,*Default,770,0,0,0,,带自动收紧功能
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.24,1:04:28.95,*Default,771,0,0,0,,你头上戴的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.12,1:04:31.07,*Default,772,0,0,0,,是绝望
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.24,1:04:33.62,*Default,773,0,0,0,,我叫它“发壳”，跟“古勒格”押韵
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.80,1:04:36.79,*Default,774,0,0,0,,这个是…我叫它“轱辘球”
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.96,1:04:38.10,*Default,775,0,0,0,,和“古勒格”押韵
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.28,1:04:39.26,*Default,776,0,0,0,,一点也不押韵…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.44,1:04:41.79,*Default,777,0,0,0,,它比鞋要快
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.60,1:04:44.47,*Default,778,0,0,0,,耶！要跟上哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.64,1:04:52.47,*Default,779,0,0,0,,我也要轱辘球
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.68,1:04:55.19,*Default,780,0,0,0,,画画已经过时了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.36,1:04:57.79,*Default,781,0,0,0,,我管它叫“快拍”
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.96,1:05:01.19,*Default,782,0,0,0,,再来一次，我眨眼了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.48,1:05:04.75,*Default,783,0,0,0,,我叫这个“眼罩”
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.96,1:05:06.87,*Default,784,0,0,0,,阳光伤不到我的眼睛了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.04,1:05:08.83,*Default,785,0,0,0,,你从哪想出这些点子的？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:10.27,*Default,786,0,0,0,,因为没有脑子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.44,1:05:12.82,*Default,787,0,0,0,,它们是从我胃里反出来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.00,1:05:15.15,*Default,788,0,0,0,,进入脑壳的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.00,1:05:19.99,*Default,789,0,0,0,,古勒格，我们得赶路啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.32,1:05:22.95,*Default,790,0,0,0,,看，我有点子，我有想法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.12,1:05:26.11,*Default,791,0,0,0,,这个，我叫它“移动的家”
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.28,1:05:27.99,*Default,792,0,0,0,,牛吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.04,1:05:33.63,*Default,793,0,0,0,,这个是“抬升器”
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.72,1:05:34.70,*Default,794,0,0,0,,妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.80,1:05:35.94,*Default,795,0,0,0,,我知道，要悲剧了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.04,1:05:42.15,*Default,796,0,0,0,,我都快看不下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.00,1:05:48.51,*Default,797,0,0,0,,不，我还看得下去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.36,1:05:51.35,*Default,798,0,0,0,,你这是想干什么啊，古勒格？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.52,1:05:55.51,*Default,799,0,0,0,,我想如果我能像盖一样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.84,1:05:57.15,*Default,800,0,0,0,,有很多点子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.04,1:06:00.15,*Default,801,0,0,0,,也许小伊就会听我的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.32,1:06:04.02,*Default,802,0,0,0,,也许她就不会想跟盖走了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.20,1:06:05.55,*Default,803,0,0,0,,古勒格
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.72,1:06:08.18,*Default,804,0,0,0,,就因为这点事儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.56,1:06:14.75,*Default,805,0,0,0,,我还希望这样能弄死你妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.92,1:06:17.38,*Default,806,0,0,0,,所以…算是双赢吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.56,1:06:18.99,*Default,807,0,0,0,,我们到了！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.60,1:06:58.55,*Default,808,0,0,0,,山洞！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.64,1:06:59.62,*Default,809,0,0,0,,大家都进去！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.80,1:07:00.91,*Default,810,0,0,0,,快！快！快进去啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.12,1:07:02.31,*Default,811,0,0,0,,快进去啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.60,1:07:05.71,*Default,812,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.44,1:07:09.95,*Default,813,0,0,0,,不要再住山洞了，古勒格
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.12,1:07:11.15,*Default,814,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.24,1:07:14.91,*Default,815,0,0,0,,我们要跳上太阳骑着它和盖一起去明天
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.08,1:07:17.38,*Default,816,0,0,0,,等等，你们都要走吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.12,1:07:20.15,*Default,817,0,0,0,,桑克？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.68,1:07:23.15,*Default,818,0,0,0,,对不起，爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.96,1:07:27.26,*Default,819,0,0,0,,你不要再为我们担心了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.48,1:07:30.15,*Default,820,0,0,0,,这是我的责任，我要遵循规定
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.32,1:07:32.15,*Default,821,0,0,0,,在这里规则不管用！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.36,1:07:33.50,*Default,822,0,0,0,,规则使我们活下来！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.68,1:07:37.75,*Default,823,0,0,0,,那不是活着，只是…没死而已
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.92,1:07:39.27,*Default,824,0,0,0,,两者是有区别的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.44,1:07:41.95,*Default,825,0,0,0,,阿加，大伙，你们得听我的！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.16,1:07:45.19,*Default,826,0,0,0,,要是听你的我们早死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.76,1:07:48.75,*Default,827,0,0,0,,我们现在听盖的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.20,1:07:54.18,*Default,828,0,0,0,,盖？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.96,1:07:56.35,*Default,829,0,0,0,,盖，快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.16,1:08:07.30,*Default,830,0,0,0,,别这样！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.52,1:08:09.27,*Default,831,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了，世界在崩塌
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.30,1:08:11.82,*Default,832,0,0,0,,你这是不理性，是在弄巧成拙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.85,1:08:12.99,*Default,833,0,0,0,,那些文绉绉的词儿激怒我了!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.56,1:08:14.70,*Default,834,0,0,0,,继续说啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.88,1:08:16.10,*Default,835,0,0,0,,启动防御装置!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.20,1:08:19.87,*Default,836,0,0,0,,记得今早的你吗？你变了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.04,1:08:21.79,*Default,837,0,0,0,,成了有想法的人，现代人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.52,1:08:25.51,*Default,838,0,0,0,,我是洞穴人！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.68,1:08:26.87,*Default,839,0,0,0,,不，不，不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.24,1:08:49.27,*Default,840,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:52.35,*Default,841,0,0,0,,这不让我揍你的东西是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.72,1:08:54.75,*Default,842,0,0,0,,柏油
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.84,1:08:57.19,*Default,843,0,0,0,,不！我得回去找他们！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.92,1:08:59.03,*Default,844,0,0,0,,别乱动！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.12,1:09:00.10,*Default,845,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.24,1:09:01.22,*Default,846,0,0,0,,快停下，古勒格！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.20,1:09:10.55,*Default,847,0,0,0,,没人能出去的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.60,1:09:13.55,*Default,848,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.54,*Default,849,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.40,1:09:17.38,*Default,850,0,0,0,,你的…？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.56,1:09:20.23,*Default,851,0,0,0,,家人，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.36,1:09:27.95,*Default,852,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.24,1:09:33.75,*Default,853,0,0,0,,当时我还很小
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.76,1:09:37.19,*Default,854,0,0,0,,我父母对我说的最后一件事是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.40,1:09:38.71,*Default,855,0,0,0,,不要躲藏
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.60,1:09:41.07,*Default,856,0,0,0,,活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.92,1:09:45.27,*Default,857,0,0,0,,追随太阳
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.44,1:09:47.55,*Default,858,0,0,0,,你就能到达明天
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.92,1:09:51.91,*Default,859,0,0,0,,你追随光明
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.72,1:09:54.71,*Default,860,0,0,0,,我女儿很像你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.88,1:09:55.91,*Default,861,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.08,1:09:57.59,*Default,862,0,0,0,,她像你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.76,1:10:00.79,*Default,863,0,0,0,,她很爱你，只是忘了对你说
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.96,1:10:03.47,*Default,864,0,0,0,,就像你忘了对她说一样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.56,1:10:11.68,*Default,865,0,0,0,,我想我只是忙着让他们活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.08,1:10:15.59,*Default,866,0,0,0,,这没错，做爸爸的都是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.28,1:10:25.07,*Default,867,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.28,1:10:27.47,*Default,868,0,0,0,,我们困在这里可成不了事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.64,1:10:30.31,*Default,869,0,0,0,,你得想个主意出来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.16,1:10:35.99,*Default,870,0,0,0,,来吧，你能行的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.32,1:10:43.31,*Default,871,0,0,0,,皮带猴，紧急点子制造机，启动！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.00,1:10:47.11,*Default,872,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:54.22,*Default,873,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.32,1:10:57.27,*Default,874,0,0,0,,我知道，但是他能做成这样已经不错了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.48,1:10:58.62,*Default,875,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.00,1:11:05.67,*Default,876,0,0,0,,他在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.84,1:11:08.55,*Default,877,0,0,0,,皮带猴，来点浪漫的，戏剧的，真诚的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.72,1:11:09.70,*Default,878,0,0,0,,让我动起来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.84,1:11:17.19,*Default,879,0,0,0,,好了，他看见我们了！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.36,1:11:19.66,*Default,880,0,0,0,,信号来了，快弄！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.00,1:11:30.22,*Default,881,0,0,0,,他没过来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.40,1:11:32.03,*Default,882,0,0,0,,我想是我们的木偶显得不够害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.20,1:11:34.55,*Default,883,0,0,0,,害怕？这我擅长！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.72,1:11:36.31,*Default,884,0,0,0,,把棍子都给我！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.72,1:11:54.39,*Default,885,0,0,0,,抓住！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.12,1:12:26.11,*Default,886,0,0,0,,噢耶！你成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:28.18,*Default,887,0,0,0,,-古勒格！  -爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.40,1:12:30.59,*Default,888,0,0,0,,嘿！我们没事儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.08,1:12:34.43,*Default,889,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.44,1:12:36.91,*Default,890,0,0,0,,我们没事儿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.80,1:12:51.43,*Default,891,0,0,0,,古勒格，你发话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.60,1:12:54.55,*Default,892,0,0,0,,带我们去明天吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.84,1:13:01.95,*Default,893,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.12,1:13:04.31,*Default,894,0,0,0,,来吧！我们可以的！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.96,1:13:07.51,*Default,895,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.68,1:13:10.11,*Default,896,0,0,0,,就在那儿！太阳！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.32,1:13:13.47,*Default,897,0,0,0,,我们能行的！我们能骑着它去明天！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.48,1:13:38.62,*Default,898,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.72,1:14:09.02,*Default,899,0,0,0,,这是…这是为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.20,1:14:12.23,*Default,900,0,0,0,,太阳就在这儿，就在这儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.88,1:14:18.47,*Default,901,0,0,0,,我们得回洞里了！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.68,1:14:20.03,*Default,902,0,0,0,,快，快，快
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.34,1:14:23.36,*Default,903,0,0,0,,呆在一起！快走，走啊…走！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.56,1:14:24.99,*Default,904,0,0,0,,都拉住我的手！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.16,1:14:27.75,*Default,905,0,0,0,,桑克，快走！快，呆在一起！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.92,1:14:31.03,*Default,906,0,0,0,,古勒格，你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.20,1:14:34.27,*Default,907,0,0,0,,古勒格，快走，不然会死的！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.92,1:15:00.03,*Default,908,0,0,0,,古勒格，听我的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.20,1:15:02.87,*Default,909,0,0,0,,我们得回山洞里去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.24,1:15:08.19,*Default,910,0,0,0,,不再有黑暗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.92,1:15:11.11,*Default,911,0,0,0,,不再去躲藏
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.64,1:15:13.59,*Default,912,0,0,0,,不再住山洞了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.28,1:15:17.27,*Default,913,0,0,0,,这些都有什么意义呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.40,1:15:23.75,*Default,914,0,0,0,,要追随光明去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.44,1:15:29.11,*Default,915,0,0,0,,我改变不了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.28,1:15:31.43,*Default,916,0,0,0,,我想不出主意
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.28,1:15:34.55,*Default,917,0,0,0,,但是我有力气
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.72,1:15:36.07,*Default,918,0,0,0,,此刻
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.24,1:15:38.54,*Default,919,0,0,0,,这正是你们所需要的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.28,1:15:42.84,*Default,920,0,0,0,,不！我们不知道那边有什么！可能什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.00,1:15:44.95,*Default,921,0,0,0,,这太冒险了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.16,1:15:48.47,*Default,922,0,0,0,,这是个机会
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.12,1:16:00.27,*Default,923,0,0,0,,我来试试吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.68,1:16:05.63,*Default,924,0,0,0,,自从我第一见到你，我就想把你扔出去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.76,1:16:08.63,*Default,925,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑，是不？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.80,1:16:10.67,*Default,926,0,0,0,,什么是开玩笑？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.04,1:16:42.59,*Default,927,0,0,0,,他成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.36,1:16:46.74,*Default,928,0,0,0,,他成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.72,1:16:51.95,*Default,929,0,0,0,,好了，桑克，该你了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.12,1:16:53.63,*Default,930,0,0,0,,你不一起过来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.16,1:16:56.62,*Default,931,0,0,0,,你过去了我就去
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.96,1:17:05.94,*Default,932,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.56,1:17:16.19,*Default,933,0,0,0,,你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.64,1:17:20.03,*Default,934,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.20,1:17:33.18,*Default,935,0,0,0,,外婆…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.36,1:17:35.51,*Default,936,0,0,0,,别肉麻了，快扔吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.28,1:17:37.42,*Default,937,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.60,1:17:40.19,*Default,938,0,0,0,,你今天让我刮目相看
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.36,1:17:41.79,*Default,939,0,0,0,,呆瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.52,1:17:49.79,*Default,940,0,0,0,,我还活着！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.76,1:17:52.03,*Default,941,0,0,0,,该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.20,1:17:53.26,*Default,942,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.48,1:17:55.51,*Default,943,0,0,0,,我有太多想说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.68,1:17:58.11,*Default,944,0,0,0,,我需弥补一切，但来不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.28,1:17:59.95,*Default,945,0,0,0,,我能弥补
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.72,1:18:05.23,*Default,946,0,0,0,,这感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.72,1:18:08.23,*Default,947,0,0,0,,你管它叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.08,1:18:12.39,*Default,948,0,0,0,,我想叫它“拥合”
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.52,1:18:15.43,*Default,949,0,0,0,,因为和“古勒格”押韵
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.56,1:18:19.71,*Default,950,0,0,0,,你要不喜欢可以改
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.68,1:18:23.63,*Default,951,0,0,0,,不，我喜欢“拥合”
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.52,1:18:30.87,*Default,952,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.60,1:18:35.58,*Default,953,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.20,1:18:42.63,*Default,954,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.44,1:18:45.11,*Default,955,0,0,0,,我害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.32,1:18:47.75,*Default,956,0,0,0,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.40,1:19:26.51,*Default,957,0,0,0,,那儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.68,1:19:27.95,*Default,958,0,0,0,,我看见他了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.76,1:20:13.74,*Default,959,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.92,1:20:15.31,*Default,960,0,0,0,,我成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.12,1:21:38.95,*Default,961,0,0,0,,别过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.16,1:21:40.99,*Default,962,0,0,0,,别过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.40,1:22:26.99,*Default,963,0,0,0,,他们危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.16,1:22:29.46,*Default,964,0,0,0,,坚持住！我来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.92,1:22:31.63,*Default,965,0,0,0,,我该怎么过去呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.84,1:22:34.95,*Default,966,0,0,0,,我得想想，盖会怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.12,1:22:37.83,*Default,967,0,0,0,,盖会怎么做？盖会怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.04,1:22:41.95,*Default,968,0,0,0,,我会怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:44.27,*Default,969,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.68,1:23:03.11,*Default,970,0,0,0,,我想到了…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.36,1:23:07.95,*Default,971,0,0,0,,一个好主意！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.52,1:23:29.66,*Default,972,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.84,1:24:12.19,*Default,973,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.68,1:24:20.82,*Default,974,0,0,0,,道格拉斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.36,1:24:23.03,*Default,975,0,0,0,,我认识他！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.32,1:24:59.91,*Default,976,0,0,0,,坚持住！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.84,1:25:44.43,*Default,977,0,0,0,,这里不安全
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.48,1:25:48.11,*Default,978,0,0,0,,我去告诉她
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.28,1:26:38.07,*Default,979,0,0,0,,我都没来得及告诉他
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.12,1:26:43.15,*Default,980,0,0,0,,小伊，如果你爸爸在这儿的话，他会和你说…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.32,1:26:46.39,*Default,981,0,0,0,,闪开！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.56,1:26:48.71,*Default,982,0,0,0,,哇，你学得好像啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.88,1:26:52.63,*Default,983,0,0,0,,闪开！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.88,1:26:53.99,*Default,984,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.16,1:26:55.38,*Default,985,0,0,0,,他成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.60,1:26:56.99,*Default,986,0,0,0,,他骑着太阳
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.38,1:27:00.38,*Default,987,0,0,0,,但骑得不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.44,1:27:02.55,*Default,988,0,0,0,,大家闪开！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.80,1:27:09.15,*Default,989,0,0,0,,-爸爸  -古勒格！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.20,1:27:12.15,*Default,990,0,0,0,,危险在哪儿？谁吹的号角？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.96,1:27:15.87,*Default,991,0,0,0,,我也爱你！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.00,1:27:27.87,*Default,992,0,0,0,,一，二，三，四
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.04,1:27:29.55,*Default,993,0,0,0,,五
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.76,1:27:30.74,*Default,994,0,0,0,,六
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.84,1:27:33.91,*Default,995,0,0,0,,七
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.52,1:27:37.71,*Default,996,0,0,0,,七个半
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.00,1:27:40.51,*Default,997,0,0,0,,还有八
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.40,1:27:42.38,*Default,998,0,0,0,,九
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.56,1:27:44.67,*Default,999,0,0,0,,道格拉斯！爸爸，你救了他！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.84,1:27:47.27,*Default,1000,0,0,0,,男孩应该有个宠物
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.40,1:27:53.83,*Default,1001,0,0,0,,没想到我和猫处得不错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.40,1:27:57.54,*Default,1002,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.60,1:28:09.87,*Default,1003,0,0,0,,你们快来看
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.76,1:28:23.43,*Default,1004,0,0,0,,我们应该去那里
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.96,1:28:26.03,*Default,1005,0,0,0,,耶！我来啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.56,1:28:30.54,*Default,1006,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.92,1:28:37.87,*Default,1007,0,0,0,,这就是我，小伊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.08,1:28:41.27,*Default,1008,0,0,0,,这是我的家人，克鲁家族
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.44,1:28:43.79,*Default,1009,0,0,0,,你应该能从晒黑的皮肤和宠物
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.00,1:28:46.63,*Default,1010,0,0,0,,判断出我们不再是穴居人了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.00,1:28:52.67,*Default,1011,0,0,0,,再来一次，我眨眼了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.32,1:28:56.23,*Default,1012,0,0,0,,我们的世界依旧充满了危险与困难
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.68,1:28:59.79,*Default,1013,0,0,0,,但现在我们知道克鲁家族能应付得了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.96,1:29:02.75,*Default,1014,0,0,0,,因为我们改变了规矩
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.92,1:29:04.75,*Default,1015,0,0,0,,不再遵循把我们囚在黑暗里的规定
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.76,1:29:11.67,*Default,1016,0,0,0,,也因为我爸爸，他教会了我们人皆可变
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.84,1:29:13.51,*Default,1017,0,0,0,,放孩子！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.80,1:29:20.19,*Default,1018,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.00,1:29:42.27,*Default,1019,0,0,0,,所以，从现在开始，我们住在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.48,1:29:44.55,*Default,1020,0,0,0,,这个能追随光明的地方
